# BOOK	001	GEN	Genesis	Kamtawngnae
001	GEN	001	001	Apuengcue vah, Cathut ni kalvan hoi talai a sak.
001	GEN	001	002	Talai teh meilam tawn hoeh. Ahrawng lah doeh ao. Hmonae ni kadung poung e hmuen a ramuk. Cathut e Muitha teh tui van a kâroe.
001	GEN	001	003	Cathut ni angnae awm seh ati teh angnae teh ao.
001	GEN	001	004	Angnae teh Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi ati teh, Cathut ni angnae teh hmonae dawk hoi a kapek.
001	GEN	001	005	Cathut ni angnae hah khodai telah a phung, hmonae hah karum telah a phung. Hottelah, tangmin hoi amom teh apasuek hnin lah ao.
001	GEN	001	006	Hahoi Cathut ni, tui lungui lathueng awmseh, tui hoi tui kâkapek seh telah ati.
