002	EXO	019	016	Apâthum hnin amom vah, mon dawk keitat, sumpa palik hoi kho tâmai muen a tabo teh, hramki lawk hoi mongka lawk a cai teh rim dawk kaawm e taminaw pueng a pâyaw awh.
002	EXO	019	017	Mosi ni hai taminaw Cathut hoi kâhmo sak hanelah, rim dawk hoi a hrawi teh mon khok koe a kangdue awh.
002	EXO	019	018	BAWIPA teh hmai hoi kâkayo teh Sinai mon dawk a kum dawkvah, Sinai mon teh hmai a khu. Hmaikhu haiyah takhuen dawk e hmaikhu patetlah a luen teh mon pueng hai a kâhuet.
002	EXO	019	019	Mongka ueng e kasawlah hoe a cai toteh, Mosi ni a kaw teh Cathut ni lawk hoi a pato.
002	EXO	019	020	BAWIPA teh Sinai monsom dawk a kum. Mosi hah mon vah a kaw dawkvah, Mosi teh mon vah a luen.
002	EXO	019	021	BAWIPA ni hai taminaw ni khet hanelah, Kai koe tho payon awh vaiteh taminaw a due awh han e hah puennae a tawn dawkvah, kum nateh kâhruetcuetnae poe.
002	EXO	019	022	BAWIPA koe ka tho e vaihmanaw haiyah amahoima a kâthoung sak a han. Nahoeh pawiteh, BAWIPA ni a rek awh han telah Mosi koe atipouh.
002	EXO	019	023	Mosi nihai, taminaw ni Sinai mon dawk luen thai awh hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tapuet hoeh hane ngangnae naw hah mon petkalup lah ka sak teh, thoungsak awh loe telah lawk yo ka thui toe telah BAWIPA koe bout a dei pouh.
002	EXO	019	024	BAWIPA ni hai kum leih. Nang hoi Aron dueng doeh ka luen han. Vaihmanaw hoi taminaw teh BAWIPA koe luen hanelah tho awh hanh naseh. Nahoeh pawiteh, ahnimouh ka rek han telah ati.
002	EXO	019	025	Mosi ni taminaw onae koe a kum teh a dei pouh.
002	EXO	020	001	Hat navah, Cathut ni a dei e lawk teh,
002	EXO	020	002	Kai teh nangmouh santoungnae hmuen, Izip ram dawk hoi na ka tâcawtkhai e nangmae Cathut Jehovah doeh.
002	EXO	020	003	Kai hloilah alouke cathut na bawk awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	020	004	Lathueng kalvan thoseh, rahim talai dawk thoseh, talai rahim tui dawk thoseh, kaawm e hno hoi mei kâvan lah, meikaphawk bawk hanlah na sak mahoeh.
002	EXO	020	005	A hmalah tabo hoi na bawk mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nange Cathut kai Jehovah teh nang dawk yon ao telah tang ka yuem e Cathut, kai na kahmuhmanaw e ca catoun se thum, se pali totouh a napanaw e yon hah a capanaw koe ka pathung e Cathut lah ka o.
002	EXO	020	006	Kai hah lungpataw ni teh ka kâpoelawknaw ka tarawi e a ca catoun, a se thongsang totouh lungmanae ka kamnuek sak e Cathut lah ka o.
002	EXO	020	007	Nange Cathut Jehovah e min hah laithoe lah dei awh hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, A min laithoe lah ka dei e tami teh yon tawn hoeh telah BAWIPA ni pouk mahoeh.
002	EXO	020	008	Sabbath hnin thoung sak hanelah, hote hnin hah pahnim awh hanh.
002	EXO	020	009	Hnin taruk touh thung thaw panki hoi tawk awh.
002	EXO	020	010	Hnin sari hnin teh na BAWIPA Cathut e Sabbath hnin lah ao. Hote hnin dawk, nang hoi na canaw, na sannu sanpanaw, saring, nange longkha thung kaawm e imyinnaw hai thaw tawk awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	020	011	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni kalvan, talai, hmuen pueng koe kaawmnaw pueng hah hnin taruk touh thung a sak teh, hnin sari hnin nah, a kâhat. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni hnin sari hnin hah yawhawi a poe teh a thoungsak.
002	EXO	020	012	Na Cathut Jehovah ni na poe e ram dawk na hringsaw nahanelah, na manu hoi na pa barih.
002	EXO	020	013	Tami thet hanh.
002	EXO	020	014	Uicuk hanh.
002	EXO	020	015	Ayâ e hno parawt hanh.
002	EXO	020	016	Na imri koe kalan hoeh e kapanuekkhaikung lah awm hanh.
002	EXO	020	017	Imri e im, a yu, a sannu sanpa, maito, marang hoi hnopai buet touh haiyah lungthin radueknae tawn hanh telah atipouh.
002	EXO	020	018	Taminaw ni keitat lawk, sumpapalik, mongka ueng lawk, mon hoi hmaikhu a tâco e naw hah a hmu awh toteh, a taki awh dawkvah, a kâhnawn awh teh ahlanae koe vah a kangdue awh.
002	EXO	020	019	Mosi koevah Nang ni lawk dei lah ka ngai awh han. Kaimouh koe Cathut lawk dei han naseh. Kaimouh ka due hane hah puen ao telah atipouh.
002	EXO	020	020	Mosi ni hai na lungpuen awh hanh. Nangmouh tanouk hanelah thoseh, nangmouh teh sak payonnae dawk hoi hlout hanelah ama taki hanelah thoseh, Cathut a tho toe telah taminaw koe a dei pouh.
002	EXO	020	021	Taminaw ni ahlanae koe vah a kangdue awh. Mosi teh Cathut onae koe kinghmonae koe lah a hnai.
002	EXO	020	022	BAWIPA ni Isarelnaw bout a dei pouh e teh, kai ni kalvan hoi nangmouh na pato e hah na panue awh toe.
002	EXO	020	023	Kai bawknae dawk namamouh hno hanlah ngun cathut thoseh, sui cathut thoseh na sak awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	020	024	Kai hanelah talai khoungroe hah na sak awh han. Hote khoungroe dawk nange hmaisawi sathei, yonthanae sathei lah kaawm e nange tu, maitonaw hah na thueng awh han. Ka min na bawknae hmuen pueng dawk nang koe ka tho vaiteh yawhawinae na poe han.
002	EXO	020	025	Nang ni talung khoungroe hah kai hanlah na sak pawiteh, talung dei e hoi na sak mahoeh. Sum hoi thuk e talung hoi sak e khoungroe teh khinnae ao.
002	EXO	020	026	Nang dawk kayanae ao hoeh nahanelah, khoungroe dawk khalai hoi na luen mahoeh telah ati.
