002	EXO	030	036	A tangawn teh katipcalah phawm hane doeh. Kai ni na pato nahane lukkareiim thung e lawkpanuesaknae hmalah na ta han. Hothateh, nang hanelah kathounge lah ao han.
002	EXO	030	037	Hote hmuitui na sak hane na pâtu e patetlah sak e teh, namamouh hanelah na sak mahoeh. BAWIPA hanelah kathounge lah na pouk awh han.
002	EXO	030	038	Tami bangpatet nihai, phunep rumram hanelah hot patet e sak pawiteh, hote tami teh a miphun thung hoi, takhoe lah ao han telah ati.
002	EXO	031	001	BAWIPA ni Mosi koevah,
002	EXO	031	002	Khenhaw! Judah miphun thung dawk hoi Hur capa Uri, hote capa Bezalel hah ka kaw toe.
002	EXO	031	003	Ahni teh lungangnae, thoumthainae, panuenae hoi bangpueng dawk kutsakthoumnae hoi,
002	EXO	031	004	sak hane Lungkaangcalah poukthainae hoi,
002	EXO	031	005	talung phu kaawm ka ta teh, bawng thainae, kâpicalah thing a thainae hoi bangpueng dawk kutsakthoumnae a tawn hanlah Cathut Muitha hoi kakawi sak toe.
002	EXO	031	006	Khenhaw! ahni koe thaw tawk hanlah, Ahisamak e capa Oholiab teh kai ni yo ka pouk toe. Tawk hanelah kâ ka poe e naw,
002	EXO	031	007	tamimaya kamkhuengnae lukkareiim, lawkpanuesaknae thingkong, avan vah lungmanae tungkhung hoi lukkareiim dawk e hnopainaw pueng,
002	EXO	031	008	caboi hoi hnopai, kathounge sui hoi sak e hmaiimkhok hoi a hnopainaw pueng, hmuitui sawinae khoungroe,
002	EXO	031	009	hmaisawi thuengnae khoungroe hoi a hnopainaw pueng, hlaam,
002	EXO	031	010	khohna kahawicalah pathoupnae hoi vaihma thaw a tawk nah a khohna hanelah, vaihma Aron hanlah kathounge khohna,
002	EXO	031	011	Kâhluk e satui hoi hmuitui kathoung hanlah hmuitui sak thai nahanlah kutsakthoumnae, lungangnae pueng ka poe. Tawk hanlah kâ ka poe e naw pueng hah a sak awh han telah a dei.
002	EXO	031	012	Hahoi BAWIPA ni Mosi koevah,
002	EXO	031	013	Isarelnaw koevah hettelah dei pouh, kaie sabbath hah na ya awh han, bangkongtetpawiteh na ca catounnaw totouh kai hoi nangmae rahak vah mitnoutnae lah ao. Kai teh nangmouh na kathoungsakkung Jehovah lah ka o tie hah na panuethai awh nahane doeh.
002	EXO	031	014	Hatdawkvah, sabbath heh na ya awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hot teh nangmouh hanlah kathounge lah ao. Ka ek e pueng teh thei lah ao han. Hote hnin dawk Bangpatete thaw hai ka tawk e pueng teh a miphun koehoi takhoe lah ao han.
002	EXO	031	015	Hnin taruk touh thung thaw tawk awh naseh. A sari hnin teh kâhatnae sabbath, BAWIPA hanlah hnin kathoung doeh. Apihai sabbath hnin vah thaw tawk pawiteh, thei lah ao roeroe han.
002	EXO	031	016	Hatdawkvah, Isarelnaw ni sabbath teh a ca catoun totouh a yungyoe lawkkam lah awm seh.
002	EXO	031	017	Kai hoi Isarelnaw rahak vah, a yungyoe mitnoutnae doeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hnin taruk touh thung vah BAWIPA ni talai hoi kalvan a sak teh, asari hnin dawk a kâhat teh a thoung sak, na ti pouh han telah ati.
002	EXO	031	018	Hottelah Sinai mon vah koung a kâpato hnukkhu, lawkpanuesaknae lungphen kahni touh, Cathut e kutdawn hoi thut e hah Mosi koe a poe.
002	EXO	032	001	Mosi teh mon hoi kum laipalah ngailawi ao toe tie tamimaya ni a panue awh toteh, tamimaya teh Aron koe a kamkhueng awh teh ahni koe thaw haw, kai mouh han lah na kahrawikung cathut sak haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Izip ram hoi na katâcawtkhaikung Mosi e bang pawlawk hai thai hoeh toe, telah ati awh.
002	EXO	032	002	Aron ni, na yunaw hoi na capanaw hoi na canunaw a pacap awh e suihnapacap hah rading awh nateh kai koe thokhai awh atipouh.
002	EXO	032	003	Hottelah tami pueng ni suihnapacap a pacap awh lahun e hah a rading awh teh Aron koe a thokhai awh.
002	EXO	032	004	Aron ni ahnimouh koe e a la teh, hreca hoi a thuk teh, maitoca meikaphawk lah a hlun. Hahoi ahnimouh ni Oe Isarelnaw, hetteh Izip ram hoi na katâcawtkhaikung nangmae cathut doeh, telah ati awh.
002	EXO	032	005	Aron ni a hmu toteh, a hmalah khoungroe hah a sak. Aron ni, tangtho vah BAWIPA hanlah pawi awm naseh telah a oung sak.
002	EXO	032	006	Hottelah a tangtho vah, amom a thaw awh. Hmaisawi thuengnae a poe awh, roum thuengnae hah a poe awh teh, tamimaya teh canei hanelah a tahung awh teh lamtu hanlah a thaw awh,
002	EXO	032	007	BAWIPA ni Mosi a pato teh, kum leih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na taminaw Izip ram hoi na tâcokhai e naw hah amamouh hoi amamouh koung a kâraphoe awh toe.
002	EXO	032	008	Kaie kâpoelawk hah tang a phen takhai awh toe. Maitoca meikaphawk a sak awh teh a bawk awh teh, hot koe thuengnae a sak awh teh, Oe Isarel hetheh Izip ram hoi na katâcawtkhaikung doeh ati awh telah ati.
002	EXO	032	009	BAWIPA ni Mosi koe hete taminaw hah ka khet toe, a lung ka patak poung e miphun doeh.
002	EXO	032	010	Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh hmai koung sawi hanelah, ahnimouh lathueng ka lungkhueknae heh kaman naseh, nang heh ka lentoe e miphun lah na sak han telah ati.
002	EXO	032	011	Mosi ni, BAWIPA Cathut koe, BAWIPA bangkongmaw kalen e thaonae hoi thaonae kut hoi Izip ram hoi na tâcosak e na taminaw lathueng vah na lungkhueknae teh a kaman.
002	EXO	032	012	Bangkongmaw Izipnaw ni monsom vah patawnae poe hane hoi, thei hanelah a tâcokhai awh, telah a dei awh han. Puenghoi na lungkhueknae hah roum sak nateh, na taminaw lathueng vah, hawihoehnae sak han na noe e heh kâhno lawih.
002	EXO	032	013	Na san Abraham hoi Isak hoi Isarel koevah kalvan e âsinaw yit touh na catounnaw ka pung sak vaiteh, ka dei tangcoung ram heh na catoun ka poe vaiteh, a yungyoe a coe awh han, telah amahoima noe lahoi lawk na kam tangcoung e hah pahnim hanh lah a telah a kâhei.
002	EXO	032	014	Hot patetlah BAWIPA teh, a taminaw lathueng vah thoenae ka sak han ati nakoehoi a kâhno.
002	EXO	032	015	Mosi teh a kamlang teh monsom hoi a kum teh, a kut dawk lawkpanuesaknae lungphen kahni touh ao. Lungphen teh avoivang lah thut e doeh.
002	EXO	032	016	Lungphen teh Cathut ni sak e lah ao teh, thut e naw teh Cathut ma roeroe ni lungphen dawk thut e doeh.
002	EXO	032	017	Hahoi Joshua ni tamimaya pawlawk a thai toteh, Mosi koevah, roenae hmuen koe kâtuknae ao nahoehmaw telah ati.
002	EXO	032	018	Hatei, ahni ni tânae pawlawk nahoeh, tâ e naw e hramki lawk hai nahoeh. Hateiteh, ka thai e heh la sak pawlawk doeh ati.
002	EXO	032	019	Hahoi, roenae teng a pha tahma hoi maitoca meikaphawk hoi kalamtunaw hah a hmu. Hottelah Mosi lungkhueknae teh a kaman teh lungphen a sin e hah a tâkhawng teh mon khok koe a kâbawng.
002	EXO	032	020	A sak awh e maitoca hah a la teh, hmai a phum teh vitkatip lah a phom. Tui dawk a phuen teh Isarelnaw hah a nei sak.
002	EXO	032	021	Mosi ni Aron koevah, hettelah totouh yonnae kalen hah ahnimouh lathueng pha sak hanelah, hetnaw ni nang lathueng bangmaw a sak awh, telah atipouh.
002	EXO	032	022	Aron ni ka bawipa lungkhueknae heh kaman payon hanh naseh. Hete tamimayanaw heh hawihoehnae koe lah pou kangvawinaw doeh tie teh na panue toe.
002	EXO	032	023	Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai koevah, kaimouh na ka hrawi hanelah cathut hah na sak pouh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Mosi Izip ram hoi na kahrawikung heh a kamthang banghai thai e lah awm hoeh toe telah ati awh.
002	EXO	032	024	Kai ni ahnimouh koe, sui katawnnaw ni rading awh naseh, ka ti pouh teh na poe awh. Hmai dawk ka phum toteh hete maitoca meikaphawk heh a tâco telah ati.
002	EXO	032	025	Hahoi tamipueng khenyawn laipalah a ngai patetlah kho a sak awh tie hah a hmu teh, bangkongtetpawiteh, a tarannaw hmunae koe Aron ni khenyawn awh hoeh.
002	EXO	032	026	Mosi teh roenae rim longkha koe a kangdue teh, BAWIPA koelah kampang e pueng kai koe tho awh naseh, telah ati. Hattoteh Levih capanaw pueng teh ahni koe a cei awh.
002	EXO	032	027	Ahnimouh koe, BAWIPA Cathut ni, tami pueng ni na tahloi lat awh nateh, roenae hmuen koe kâennae longkha koehoi tâconae longkha koe totouh, na hmaunawngha thoseh, na huiko thoseh, na imri thoseh thet awh atipouh.
002	EXO	032	028	Hatdawkvah, Levih capanaw ni Mosi ni dei e patetlah a sak awh teh, hot hnin vah tami 3, 000 tabang a due awh.
002	EXO	032	029	Hattoteh Mosi ni, sahnin yawhawinae na poe awh nahanelah, na mahmawk BAWIPA hanelah kâhmoun awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami pueng ni a capa hoi a hmaunawngha hah a taran toe, telah ati.
002	EXO	032	030	Hahoi, a tangtho vah Mosi ni tamimaya koevah, yonnae kalen na sak awh toe. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA koe ka ceitakhang han. Na yonnae yontha thai han vaimoe, telah ati.
002	EXO	032	031	Hottelah Mosi teh BAWIPA koe a ban teh, Oe hetnaw ni yonnae kalen a sak awh teh, sui cathut hah a sak awh.
002	EXO	032	032	Hatei nakunghai, a yonnae hah ngaithoum pouh haw. Hatei, na ngaithoum hoehpawiteh na cauk dawk na thut e ka min hah raphoe hanelah ka kâhei atipouh.
002	EXO	032	033	BAWIPA ni Mosi koevah, kai taranlahoi yonnae ka sak e pueng teh, ka cauk dawk hoi a min ka raphoe han.
002	EXO	032	034	Hatdawkvah cet nateh, ka dei e hmuen koe tamimaya hah cetkhaih. Khenhaw! kaie kalvantaminaw na hmalah a cei han. Hatei, rek hanelah ka hloe awh nah hnin vah, a yonnae dawk roeroe ka rek awh han telah ati.
002	EXO	032	035	Hottelah Aron ni a sak e patetlah maitoca meikaphawk a sak awh dawkvah, BAWIPA ni tamimaya teh a rek.
002	EXO	033	001	Hottelah BAWIPA ni Mosi hah a pato teh, hi hoi tâcawt awh nateh, Abraham, Isak hoi Jakop koevah, na catounnaw hanelah na poe han telah thoebo laihoi lawk ka kam e ram dawk, nang hoi Izip ram hoi na tâcokhai e naw hoi cet takhang awh.
002	EXO	033	002	Nangmae hmalah kalvantami ka patoun vaiteh, Kanaan taminaw, Amor taminaw, Hit taminaw, Periznaw, Hivnaw hoi Jubusitnaw hah ka pâlei han.
002	EXO	033	003	Khoitui hoi maitosanutui a lawngnae ram dawk cet takhang awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai teh nangmouh koe ka cet takhang van mahoeh. A lung ka patak poung e lah na o awh dawkvah, lamlak vah koung na pathup payon han doeh telah ati.
002	EXO	033	004	Hottelah tamimaya ni hete kamthang kathout a thai awh toteh, a ka awh teh apihai kamthoup ngai awh hoeh.
002	EXO	033	005	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni Mosi koe Isarel catounnaw koe vah, a lung ka patak poung e miphun lah na o awh, nangmouh koe dongdeng ka o nakunghai, koung na pathup awh han. Hatdawkvah nangmouh koe ka sak hane ka panue thai nahanelah, na kamthoupnae pueng hah koung rading awh telah a dei toe.
002	EXO	033	006	Hatdawkvah Isarelnaw ni a kamthoupnae hah Horeb mon vah a kârading awh.
002	EXO	033	007	Mosi ni Lukkareiim hah a ceikhai teh, roenae lawilah betbet ahlanae koe ouk a yap. Hot hah kamkhuengnae lukkareiim ati awh. Hahoi BAWIPA tawng ka ngai e pueng teh, roenae lawilah kamkhuengnae lukkareiim dawkvah ouk a cei awh.
002	EXO	033	008	Hahoi, Mosi teh lukkareiim pâtam hoi a cei lahun nah, tamimaya a thaw awh teh amamae rim takhang koe a kangdue awh teh, Mosi lukkareiim thung a kâen totouh a khet awh.
002	EXO	033	009	Hahoi Mosi teh lukkareiim dawk a kâen tahma vah, tâmaikhom a kum teh lukkareiim takhang koe a kangdue teh BAWIPA ni Mosi hah a pato.
002	EXO	033	010	Hahoi tamimaya ni lukkareiim takhang koe tâmaikhom a kangdue e hah a hmu awh. Hat toteh, tamimaya teh a thaw awh teh, amamae rim takhang koehoi lengkaleng a bawk awh.
002	EXO	033	011	Tami ni a hui a pato e patetlah, BAWIPA ni Mosi hah minhmai kâhmo laihoi a pato teh, roenae hmuen koe lah a ban. A san Nun capa thoundoun Joshua hateh lukkareiim cettakhai boihoeh.
002	EXO	033	012	Mosi ni BAWIPA koevah, khenhaw! nang ni kai koevah hetnaw heh luenkhai loe ati. Hatei apimaw kai koe na patoun han tie teh na panuek sak hoeh rah. Hatei, nang ni na min lahoi na panue teh, ka mit dawk minhmai kahawi ka hmu, na ti pouh.
002	EXO	033	013	Hatdawkvah, na mit dawk minhmai kahawi ka hmawt pawiteh, ka panue nahan hoi na mithmu vah pahrennae ka hmu thai nahanlah lamthung na panuek sak haw, telah ka kâhei. Hete miphun heh na tamimaya doeh tie hah pouk, telah ati.
002	EXO	033	014	Ahni ni, nangmouh koe ka o vaiteh, kâhatnae na poe awh han atipouh.
002	EXO	033	015	Ahni ni, kai koevah na cet hoehpawiteh, hete hmuen koehoi na tâcawt sak hanh.
002	EXO	033	016	Bangkongtetpawiteh, kaimouh koe na cet laipalah kai hoi na taminaw teh na mithmu vah lungmanae ka hmu awh tie hah, bangtelamaw ka panue awh han. Hottelah talai van kaawm e taminaw pueng koehoi kai hoi na taminaw teh ka pek e lah ka o awh han, atipouh.
002	EXO	033	017	BAWIPA ni Mosi koevah, hot hai na dei e patetlah ka sak han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka mit dawk na kuep teh na min lahoi na panue telah atipouh.
002	EXO	033	018	Ahni ni na bawilennae teh pahren lahoi na hmawt sak haw atipouh.
002	EXO	033	019	Ahni ni, ka hawinae pueng heh na hmalah ka kamnue sak vaiteh, Jehovah min hah na hmalah ka pâpho han. Pahren han ka ngai e hah ka pahren vaiteh, ka lungma han ka ngai e pueng hah ka lungma han, atipouh.
002	EXO	033	020	Hatei ahni ni, ka minhmai teh na hmawt thai mahoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh na ka hmawt e tami hring boihoeh, ati.
002	EXO	033	021	BAWIPA ni khenhaw! ka teng vah hmuen buet touh ao, lungsong van na kangdue han.
002	EXO	033	022	Hahoi, ka bawilennae ni na ceihlawi navah, kâbawng e lungsong thungvah na ta han, na ceitakhai hoehroukrak ka kut hoi na tabuem han.
002	EXO	033	023	Hahoi ka kut hah bout ka la vaiteh ka hnukthun hah na hmu han, hatei, ka minhmai teh na hmawt mahoeh, atipouh.
002	EXO	034	001	BAWIPA ni Mosi koevah, lungphen kahni touh a hmaloe e patetlah sak nateh hote lungphen dawkvah ahmaloe e patetlah bout ka thut han.
002	EXO	034	002	Tangtho vah coungkacoe lah awmh, amom Sinai mon dawk luen nateh, monsom ka hmalah kangdout.
002	EXO	034	003	Nang koe apihai tho awh hanh naseh. Mon vah apihai kamnuek awh nahanh seh. Tuhu hoi maitohu naw hai mon teng vah pâ awh nahanh seh ati.
002	EXO	034	004	Hottelah lungphen kahni touh hmaloe e patetlah a sak. Hahoi Mosi teh amom vah a thaw teh BAWIPA ni kâ a poe e patetlah lungphen kahni touh hah a sin teh, Sinai mon dawk a luen.
002	EXO	034	005	BAWIPA teh tâmai hoi a kum teh, a teng vah a kangdue teh BAWIPA e min hah a pathang.
002	EXO	034	006	BAWIPA ni a ceihlawi teh Jehovah, Jehovah, lungmanae hoi kakawi e Cathut, pahrennae, lungsawnae lungmanae hoi lawkkatang hoi akawi.
002	EXO	034	007	Tami a thongsang koe pahrennae kamnueksakkung, payonnae hoi lawkeknae hoi, hawihoehnae kangaithoumkung, yonpennae ka tâcawtkhai boihoeh e, napanaw payonnae dawk canaw catoun totouh, se thum se pali totouh karekkung doeh telah a pâpho.
002	EXO	034	008	Mosi ni karanglah talai dawk a tabo teh a bawk.
002	EXO	034	009	Ahni ni, Atuvah BAWIPA na mit dawk minhmai kahawi ka hmawt pawiteh, kai koevah kaie BAWIPA heh cet van naseh telah ka kâhei. A lung ka patak e miphun lah ka o awh nakunghai ka payonnae hoi ka yonnae hah na ngaithoum nateh, na râw lah na tawn lawih telah ati.
002	EXO	034	010	Ahni ni, khenhaw! lawkkamnae ka sak. Talai pueng hoi miphun pueng dawk sak boihoeh e kângairu hno hah na taminaw pueng hmalah ka sak vaiteh, nangmouh kaawm e na taminaw pueng ni BAWIPA ni sak e hah a hmu awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nangmouh koe ka sak hane heh takikathopounge lah ao han.
002	EXO	034	011	Sahnin vah kâ na poe e naw heh pouk. Khenhaw! Amornaw, Kanaannaw, Hitnaw, Hivnaw, Periznaw hoi Jebusitnaw hah na hmalah hoi ka pâlei han.
002	EXO	034	012	Kâhruetcuet, hoehpawiteh na cei nahane ram dawk kaawmnaw hoi lawkkamnae na sak awh vaiteh, nangmouh hanlah karap lah awm payon vaih.
002	EXO	034	013	Hateiteh ahnimae khoungroe hah, koung na raphoe pouh han. Talung a ung awh e hai rekrek dei awh nateh, thing meikaphawk hah koung tâtueng pouh awh.
002	EXO	034	014	A min patenghai dipma Jehovah lah ao, Cathut teh a dipma thai dawkvah Cathut alouke roeroe na bawk awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	034	015	Hoehpawiteh hote ram dawk e taminaw hoi lawk na kam awh vaiteh, ahnimae cathut koe kâyo laihoi ahnimae cathut koe thueng laihoi buetbuet touh coun vaiteh, thuengnae moi hah ca hoi,
002	EXO	034	016	na capanaw hanelah ahnimae canunaw hah na paluen vaiteh, a canunaw ni a cathutnaw koe a kâyo awhnae koe, na capanaw hai kâyawt payon awh langvaih.
002	EXO	034	017	Thuk e meikaphawk cathut hah na sak awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	034	018	Tonphuenhoehe vaiyei pawi na sak han. Kâ na poe awh e patetlah, hnin sari touh thung tonphuenhoehe hah Abib thapa dawk khoe e tueng nah na ca han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Abib thapa dawkvah Izip ram hoi na tâco awh.
002	EXO	034	019	Camoim ka paawng e pueng kaie doeh. Na saring pueng maito hoi tu camin teh kaie doeh.
002	EXO	034	020	Hatei la camin teh tuca hoi na ratang han. Na ratang ngaihoeh pawiteh, a lahuen na kapai pouh han. Na capa camin teh na ratang han. Ka hmaitung vah apihai kuthrawng hoi na tâcawt awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	034	021	Hnin taruk touh thung thaw na tawk han. Asari hnin dawk na kâhat han. Laikawk na tawk tue nah hoi canga tue nahai na kâhat han.
002	EXO	034	022	Yat pawi, takhawk pawi, cavanca pawi na to han.
002	EXO	034	023	Tongpa pueng kum touh dawk vai thum touh Bawipa Jehovah Isarel Cathut hmalah a tâco awh han.
002	EXO	034	024	Bangkongtetpawiteh, na hmalah miphunnaw ka pâlei vaiteh na ramri hah ka kaw sak han, kum touh dawk vai thum touh BAWIPA na Cathut hmalah na tâco awh nahanlah na cei toteh apinihai na ram hah noe awh mahoeh.
002	EXO	034	025	Kai hanelah thuengnae thipaling teh ton phuen e vaiyei hoi na poe mahoeh. Ceitakhai pawi thuengnae haiyah atangtho totouh na awm sak mahoeh.
002	EXO	034	026	Na law dawk e aluepaw teh BAWIPA im dawk na thokhai han. Hmaeca e moi hah a manu e sanutui hoi mek na thawng mahoeh.
