005	DEU	008	002	Nange BAWIPA Cathut ni kâpoelawk tarawi ngainae lung na tawn hoi tawn hoeh e na tanouk awh teh, ka loum tangcoung kum 40 touh thung kahrawngum vah na hrawinae naw hah na pahnim awh mahoeh.
005	DEU	008	003	Hottelah na lungthin rahnoum awh teh, kahaikahlam lah na o sak navah, na panue e nahoeh, na mintoenaw ni panue boihoeh e manna hoi na kawk awh teh, tami teh vaiyei hoi dueng hring hoeh, BAWIPA e lawk lahoi doeh hring tie a panue sak.
