012	2KI	023	035	Jehoiakim ni Faro hah ngun tangka hoi sui a poe teh, ahnimae ram teh Faro ni kâ a poe e patetlah tangka lah poe hane tamuk a cawng van. Faro Neko koe poe hanlah, tami pueng rawng hanelah a khoe pouh e patetlah hote ram thung e khocanaw hah sui hoi tangka a rawng sak awh.
012	2KI	023	036	Jehoiakim teh siangpahrang a tawk navah, kum 25 touh a pha. Jerusalem vah kum 11 touh a bawi. A manu min teh Zebudah Ramah kho e Pedaiah canu doeh.
012	2KI	023	037	Hahoi a na mintoenaw ni a sak awh e patetlah BAWIPA mithmu vah thoenae hah a sak.
012	2KI	024	001	Ahnie se navah Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar ni a muk. Hatdawkvah Jehoiakim teh san lah kum thum touh a toung. Hathnukkhu, bout a kamlang teh Nebukhadnezar a tuk.
012	2KI	024	002	BAWIPA ni a san profetnaw hno lahoi a dei tangcoung e patetlah BAWIPA ni Khaldean tamihu, Siria tamihu, Moab tamihu hoi Ammon tamihu naw hah Judahnaw tuk hane hoi raphoe hanelah a patoun.
012	2KI	024	003	Manasseh ni a sak e pueng, tamikayon hoeh e naw a thi palawng e hoi, kayonhoehnaw e thi paling hoi Jerusalem akawi sak dawkvah, BAWIPA ni ngaithoum hane ngai hoeh.
012	2KI	024	004	Judahnaw a hmaitung hoi takhoe hanelah BAWIPA e kâpoelawk teh a pha katang.
012	2KI	024	005	Hottelah Jehoiakim tawksaknae thung hoi kacawiraenaw hoi a kâroenae naw pueng teh Judah siangpahrangnaw e setouknae cauk dawk thut lah ao nahoehmaw.
012	2KI	024	006	Jehoiakim teh mintoenaw koe a kâhat teh a capa Jehoiakhin ni a yueng lah a uk.
012	2KI	024	007	Izip siangpahrang teh a ram thung hoi tho hoeh toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Babilon siangpahrang ni Izip palangnaw koehoi a kamtawng teh Euphrates palang totouh Izip siangpahrang uknae pueng hah koung a la toe.
012	2KI	024	008	Jehoiakhin siangpahrang thaw tawk a kamtawng nah a kum 18 touh a pha. Jerusalem vah thapa yung thum touh a bawi. A manu e min teh Nehushta, Jerusalem kho e Elnathan canu doeh.
012	2KI	024	009	A na pa ni a sak e patetlah BAWIPA mithmu vah thoenae a sak.
012	2KI	024	010	Hatdawkvah Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar e taminaw Jerusalem lah a ceitakhang awh teh, kho king a kalup awh.
012	2KI	024	011	Hahoi Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar khopui dawk a tho navah a sannaw ni khopui teh koung la a kalup awh toe.
012	2KI	024	012	Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakhin ni a manu, a sannaw, ukkungnaw hoi a sannaw hoi Babilon siangpahrang koe a tâco awh. Hatdawkvah a bawinae kum 8 nah Babilon siangpahrang ni a man.
012	2KI	024	013	BAWIPA ni a dei tangcoung e patetlah BAWIPA e im dawk e hno hoi siangpahrang im dawk e hnonaw pueng koung a la teh, BAWIPA e bawkim dawk hanelah Isarel siangpahrang Solomon ni a sak e sui hnopai pueng reprep koung a dei pouh.
012	2KI	024	014	Jerusalem e tami pueng ka lentoe e taminaw hoi a thakaawme taminaw 10, 000 touh, hnikawng kathoumnaw hoi sumdêikathoumnaw pueng koung a hrawi. Hahoi ram thung e ka roedeng e tami hoi cungkeihoehe tami laipateh pihai cettakhai awh hoeh.
012	2KI	024	015	Jehoiakhin e a sannaw hoi hote ram dawk e tami thakaawme taminaw Jerusalem hoi Babilon lah santoung hanlah a ceikhai awh.
012	2KI	024	016	Babilon siangpahrang ni thakasai e tami 7, 000 hni kawng kathoum e hoi sumdêikathoum e tami 1, 000 touh hoi tarantuk kathoumnaw Babilon lah koung a ceikhai.
012	2KI	024	017	Babilon siangpahrang ni Jehoiakhin yueng lah, a panga Mattaniah hah siangpahrang thaw a tawk sak awh teh Zedekiah telah a min a palang pouh awh.
012	2KI	024	018	Zedekiah siangpahrang a tawk navah kum 21 touh a pha. Jerusalem vah kum 11 touh a bawi. A manu e min teh Hamutal, Libnah kho e Jeremiah canu doeh.
012	2KI	024	019	Jehoiakhin ni a sak e hno pueng a sak teh BAWIPA mithmu vah thoenae a sak.
012	2KI	024	020	Judahnaw hoi Jerusalem e taminaw e hmaitung hoi a takhoe hoehroukrak BAWIPA teh a lungkhuek. Hahoi Zedekiah ni Babilon siangpahrang a tuk.
012	2KI	025	001	Hahoi a bawinae kum 6 nae thapa yung 10, hnin 10 hnin vah hettelah ao. Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar hoi a ransanaw pueng hoi Jerusalem taranlahoi a tho awh teh a roe sin awh. A tengpam abuemlah tarantuknae tangkom koung a tai awh.
012	2KI	025	002	Hottelah siangpahrang Zedekiah a bawinae kum 11 totouh kho teh a kalup awh.
012	2KI	025	003	Thapa yung 4 nah hnin 9 hnin vah ram thung e taminaw hanelah rawca laipalah ka patawpoung e takang a tho.
012	2KI	025	004	Hahoi khopui kalupnae tapang hah vak a muk awh teh, karum lah tarankatuknaw teh siangpahrang takha teng e kalupnae tapang kahni touh e rahak kalupnae longkha koe lah a yawng awh. Khaldean taminaw ni kho hah king a ring awh teh siangpahrang teh tanghling lam koe lah a cei.
012	2KI	025	005	Hatei teh, Khaldean ransanaw ni siangpahrang hah pâlei awh teh, Jeriko tanghling dawk a pha awh, a ransanaw pueng ni dung a yawng takhai awh.
012	2KI	025	006	Siangpahrang hah a man awh teh Riblah vah Babilon siangpahrang koe a hrawi awh teh lawk a ceng awh.
012	2KI	025	007	Zedekiah e capa hah a mithmu vah a thei awh. Zedekiah e a mitmu hah a cawngkhawi awh teh, king a katek nalaihoi Babilon vah a hrawi awh.
012	2KI	025	008	Hottelah Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar a bawinae kum 9, thapa yung 5, hnin 7 hnin vah Babilon siangpahrang karingkungnaw kahrawikung, Nebuzaradan teh Jerusalem vah a kâen.
012	2KI	025	009	BAWIPA im hoi siangpahrang im hah hmai a sawi awh teh Jerusalem imnaw pueng im kalennaw pueng hah hmai koung a sawi awh.
012	2KI	025	010	Karingnaw kahrawikungnaw koe kaawm e Khaldean ransanaw pueng ni Jerusalem rapannaw pueng hah a raphoe awh.
012	2KI	025	011	Khopui thung kaawm rae naw pueng hoi, Babilon siangpahrang koe lah kaawm e taminaw pueng hoi, karingkungnaw kahrawikung Nebuzaradan ni san lah a hrawi awh.
012	2KI	025	012	Hote ram dawk e karoedengnaw, banghai cungkeihoehe naw karingkungnaw kahrawikung ni takhakatawkkungnaw hoi law kaphawnaw lah a ta awh.
012	2KI	025	013	Bawipa im dawk e rahum khompui hoi, rahum e tui im, tui kamhluknae naw hah Khaldean taminaw ni rakrak a hem awh teh rahum naw hah Babilon vah a sin awh.
012	2KI	025	014	Hlaam hoi hraba kawnnae, hmaiim, paitei, pacen hoi, rahum ailo, tongben pueng, thawngnae hnopai pueng koung a la awh.
012	2KI	025	015	Tongben hoi, hlaam, sui hoi ngun hoi sak e hnopainaw pueng karingkungnaw kahrawikung ni koung a la pouh.
012	2KI	025	016	Solomon ni BAWIPA im hanelah a sak e khom kahni touh hoi rahum tuiim hoi rahum pâhungnae amkhoung, rahum a ri e teh panue thai hanelah awm hoeh.
012	2KI	025	017	Khom ka rasang poung e teh dong 18 touh a pha teh, a som vah rahum khom pasum e ao. Hate rahum khom pasum e teh dong 3 touh a rasang, rahum khom pasum e dawk rahum em hoi, rahumnaw hoi akawi. Alouke khomnaw hai hottelah ao teh, rahum emnaw hoi akawi.
012	2KI	025	018	Karingkungnaw kahrawikung ni vaihma bawi Seraiah hoi vaihma Zephaniah hoi tho ka ring e kathum touh a man.
012	2KI	025	019	Taran ka tuk e ransabawi buet touh hoi siangpahrang ouk a kâhmonae khopui dawk hmu e 5 touh hoi cakathutkung hoi khopui thung hmu e naw hah ram thung e 60 touh hoi khopui thung hoi a man awh.
012	2KI	025	020	Karingkungnaw kahrawikung Nebuzaradan ni Riblah hoi Babilon siangpahrang koevah a ceikhai.
012	2KI	025	021	Babilon siangpahrang ni Hamath ram e Riblah vah a thei awh. Hahoi teh, Judahnaw teh a ram dawk hoi san lah a hrawi awh.
012	2KI	025	022	Hahoi Babilon siangpahrang Nebukhadnezar ni, Judah ram a ta e tami thung dawk Shaphan capa, Ahikam capa Gadaliah hah bawi lah a ta awh.
012	2KI	025	023	Hahoi teh, ransa kahrawikungnaw pueng hoi a kut rahim e naw ni Babilon siangpahrang ni, Gadaliah teh bawi lah a sak toe tie a panue awh toteh, Mizpah vah Gadaliah koevah a cei awh. Hotnaw teh, Nathaniah capa Ishmael, Kareah capa Johanan, Netophah tami Tanhumeth capa Seraiah, Maakath capa Jaazaniah hoi a kut rahim e naw doeh.
012	2KI	025	024	Gedaliah ni hote taminaw hoi a taminaw koevah, lawkkamnae a sak teh ahnimouh koe Khaldeannaw e san lah o hanelah taket hanh awh. Het ram dawk ma pou awm awh. Babilon siangpahrang kâ ngainae rahim vah awm awh nateh, namamouh hane kahawi han atipouh.
012	2KI	025	025	Hatei thapa yung 7 nah, siangpahrang catoun Elishama capa Nathaniah capa Ishmael ni tami 10 touh a ceikhai teh, Gedaliah teh Mizpah e Judahnaw koe kaawm e Khaldean taminaw hoi a tuk awh teh be a thei awh.
012	2KI	025	026	Hottelah taminaw pueng kalen, kathoung ransabawinaw hoi a tâco teh, Izip ram vah a cei awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Khaldean taminaw, a taki awh dawk doeh.
012	2KI	025	027	Hahoi Jehoiakhin san lah a onae kum 37, thapa 12, hnin 27 nah Babilon siangpahrang, Evilmerodak ni a bawinae kum nah Judah siangpahrang Jehoiakhin teh, thongim thung hoi a hlout sak.
012	2KI	025	028	Kahawicalah kho a pouk teh Babilon vah ahni koe kaawm e siangpahrangnaw hlak ka rasang poung e tungkhung a poe.
012	2KI	025	029	Jehoiakhin teh, thongim a bonae khohna a kâthung teh a hringyung thung pueng siangpahrang hmalah a ca a nei.
012	2KI	025	030	A hringyung thung hnintangkuem a ca hanelah siangpahrang ni a poe teh a coe sak.
