013	1CH	002	051	Bethlehem na pa Salma, Bethgader na pa Hareph hai ao.
013	1CH	002	052	Kiriathjearim na pa Shobal casak thung hoi Manahati tangawn, Haroehnaw hai ao rah.
013	1CH	002	053	Kiriathjearim casak dawkvah Ithrite hoi Puthit, Shumati, Mishraitinaw ao awh teh, hetnaw koehoi Zorath hoi Eshtaol lah a tâco.
013	1CH	002	054	Salma casak Bethlehem, Netophah, Atrothbethjoab hoi Manahati tangawn Zorithnaw hah doeh.
013	1CH	002	055	Cakathutkungnaw casak lah kaawm e teh Jabez, Tirathites, Shimeathi hoi Shukathi doeh. Hetnaw heh Rekhab imthung e a na pa Khammath koehoi ka tâcawt e Keninaw doeh.
013	1CH	003	001	Hetnaw heh Devit casaknaw lah ao awh. Ahni hanlah Hebron vah Jezreel Ahinoam ni a camin Amnon a sak pouh. Apâhni lah Karmel Abigail ni Daniel a sak pouh.
013	1CH	003	002	Apâthum nah siangpahrang Geshur Talmai canu Maakah capa Absalom, apali nah Haggith capa Adonijah.
013	1CH	003	003	Apanga nah Abital capa Shephatiah, ataruk nah a yu Eglah capa Ithream,
013	1CH	003	004	Hebron vah hete capa taruk touh heh a sak toe. Hawvah, kum sari touh hoi thapa yung taruk touh a uk teh, Jerusalem vah kum 33 touh a uk.
013	1CH	003	005	Jerusalem vah a sak e naw teh: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon naw doeh. Ammiel canu Bathshua hoi pali touh a sak.
