013	1CH	003	007	Nogah, Nepheg hoi Japhia.
013	1CH	003	008	Elishama, Eliada hoi Eliphelet, tako touh a pha awh.
013	1CH	003	009	Hetnaw pueng teh Devit casaknaw doeh, adonaw e casaknaw hai ao rah. Hahoi Tamar teh ahnimae tawncanu doeh.
013	1CH	003	010	Solomon casaknaw teh: Rehoboam, Rehoboam capa Abijah, Abijah capa Asa, Asa capa Jehoshaphat.
013	1CH	003	011	Jehoshaphat capa Joram, Joram capa Ahaziah, Ahaziah capa Joash,
013	1CH	003	012	Ahaziah capa Amaziah, Amaziah capa Azariah, Azariah capa Jotham.
013	1CH	003	013	Jotham capa Ahaz, Ahaz capa Hezekiah, Hezekiah capa Manasseh.
013	1CH	003	014	Manasseh capa Amon, Amon capa Josiah.
013	1CH	003	015	Josiah casak teh a camin he Johanan, apâhni lah Jehoiakim, apâthum lah Zedekiah, apali lah Shallum.
