013	1CH	004	001	Judah casak teh Perez, Khetsron, Karmi, Hur, Shobal.
013	1CH	004	002	Shobal capa Reaiah ni Jahath a sak. Jahath ni Ahumai hoi Lahad a sak. Hetnaw teh Zorath e casaknaw doeh
013	1CH	004	003	Etam na pa e canaw teh Jezreel, Ishma hoi Idbash doeh, a tawncanu min teh Hazzelelponi doeh.
013	1CH	004	004	Gedor na pa Penuel hoi Hushah na pa Ezer. Hetteh Bethlehem na pa Epharath e camin Hur casak doeh.
013	1CH	004	005	Tekoa na pa Ashhur heh a yu kahni touh, Helah hoi Naarah a tawn.
013	1CH	004	006	Ahni hanlah Naarah ni Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, Haahashtari a sak pouh. Hetnaw heh Naarah casak lah ao.
013	1CH	004	007	Helah casaknaw teh: Zereth, Zohar hoi Ethan.
013	1CH	004	008	Koz ni Anub hoi Zobebah a sak teh Harum capa Aharhel casak lah ao.
013	1CH	004	009	Telah ao navah, Jabez teh a hmaunawnghanaw thung dawk minhmai khet e tami lah ao. A manu ni reithai nalaihoi ka khe e doeh ati teh, a min teh Jabez a phung.
013	1CH	004	010	Jabez teh Isarel Cathut koevah, Yawhawi na poe roeroe haw, ka ram teh kaw sak haw, na kut hoi na awmkhai nateh, lungmathoenae kai koe a pha hoeh nahanelah, yonnae thung hoi na hlout sak haw, telah a hram teh, ahni ni a hei e hah a poe.
013	1CH	004	011	Shuhah e a nawngha Kelub ni Eshton na pa Mehir a sak.
013	1CH	004	012	Eshton ni Bethrapha, Paseah, Nahash khopui na pa Tehinah a sak. Hetnaw heh Rekah taminaw doeh.
013	1CH	004	013	Kenaz casaknaw teh: Othniel, Seraiah. Othniel casak teh Hathath.
013	1CH	004	014	Meonothai ni Ophrah a sak teh Seraiah ni Gekharashim na pa Joab a sak.
013	1CH	004	015	Jephunneh capa Kaleb casak teh Iru, Elah hoi Naam, Elah e capa teh Kenaz doeh.
013	1CH	004	016	Jehallelel casak teh Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria hoi Asarel.
013	1CH	004	017	Ezrah casak teh Jether, Mered, Epher, Jalon doeh. Miriam ni Shammai hoi Eshtemoa na pa Ishbah a khe pouh.
013	1CH	004	018	Ahnie yu Jehudijah ni Gedor na pa Jered, Sokoh na pa Heber, Zanoah na pa Jekuthiel a sak. Hetnaw teh Mered ni a la e Faro canu Bithiah canaw doeh.
013	1CH	004	019	Hodiah yu casak teh Karmi Keilah na pa Naham tawncanu hoi Maakath Eshtemoa doeh.
013	1CH	004	020	Shimon casak teh Amnon, Rinnah, Benhanan, Tilon. Ishi casak teh Zoheth hoi Benzoheth.
013	1CH	004	021	Judah capa Shelah casak teh Lekah na pa Er, Mareshah na pa Laadah doeh. Ashbe imthung dawk teh loukloukkaang e lukkarei ka sak thai e hai ao.
013	1CH	004	022	Jokim hoi Kozeba tami hoi Joash, Moab vah yu ka lat e Seraph hoi Jashubilehem. Palang thut e naw doeh.
