013	1CH	004	026	Mishma casak lah, Mishma capa Hammuel, Hammuel capa Zakkur, Zakkur capa Shimei.
013	1CH	004	027	Shimei te capa hlaitaruk touh hoi canu taruk touh ao awh ei, a hmaunawnghanaw teh ca moi tawn awh hoeh. Hatdawkvah, ahnimae canaw pueng teh Judah casak patetlah la pung awh hoeh.
013	1CH	004	028	Beersheba, Moladah, Hazarshual,
013	1CH	004	029	Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad,
013	1CH	004	030	Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag,
013	1CH	004	031	Bethmarkaboth, Hazarsusim, Bethbiri, Shaaraim vah kho a sak awh. Hetnaw heh Devit a bawi nah totouh ahnimae khopui lah ao.
013	1CH	004	032	Ahnimae khotenaw teh Etam, Ayin, Rimmon, Tokhen, Ashan hoi kho panga touh.
013	1CH	004	033	Ahnimae khote pueng teh khopui tengpam vah Baal totouh ao awh. Hetnaw teh khosaknae lah ao awh teh, a napanaw e konglam thut e hai a tawn awh.
013	1CH	004	034	Meshobab, Jamlekh hoi Amaziah capa Joshah.
013	1CH	004	035	Joel hoi Asiel casak Seraiah, Joshibiah capa Jehu.
013	1CH	004	036	Elioenai, Jaakobah, Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel hoi Benaiah.
013	1CH	004	037	Shiphi capa Ziza, Allon capa Shiphi, Jedaiah capa Allon, Shimri capa Jedaiah, Shemaiah capa Shimri.
013	1CH	004	038	Hete a min kaawm e naw teh casaknaw ka hrawi e lah ao teh, imthung teh moikapap a kamphung awh.
013	1CH	004	039	Ahnimanaw teh Gedor kâennae tanghling kanîtholah totouh saringnaw pâ nahane tawng hanelah a cei awh.
013	1CH	004	040	Saringnaw pâ nahane, hram ca hane kahawipoung e ram lah a hmu awh. A ram a kaw teh karoumcalah onae hmuen lah ao. Hmaloe la kaawm e teh Ham catounnaw doeh.
013	1CH	004	041	Hetteh Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah tue navah a min hoi a thut e naw doeh kamnuek. Hatnavah, ahnimae rimnaw hoi Mehunimnaw teh a thei awh teh atu totouh hote hmuen koe ao awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, saringnaw a pâ nahanlah ao dawkvah.
013	1CH	004	042	Simeon casak tami 500 touh hane Seir mon dawk a luen awh. Hatnavah Ishi canaw Pelatiah, Neariah, Rephaiah hoi Uzziel tinaw teh a lû lah ao awh.
013	1CH	004	043	Amalek miphun, ka yawng e naw dawk hoi kaawm e naw hah a tâ awh teh, atu totouh kho a sak sin awh.
013	1CH	005	001	Isarel e camin teh Reuben e capanaw katang doeh. Hateiteh, a na pa e ikhun a khin sak dawkvah, camin lah a onae hah Isarel e capa Joseph e capanaw koe poe e lah ao. Hatdawkvah, setouknae dawk camin lah a onae hah pakhum e lah awm hoeh.
013	1CH	005	002	Judah teh a hmaunawnghanaw hlak a tha a sai teh, ahni dawk hoi kaukkung a tâco. Camin lah a onae teh Joseph ni a coe.
013	1CH	005	003	Isarel camin Reuben e casaknaw teh Hanok, Pallu, Hezron hoi Karmi.
013	1CH	005	004	Joel casak teh, a capa Shemaiah, Shemaiah capa Gog, Gog capa Shimei.
013	1CH	005	005	Shimei capa Maikah, Mikah capa Reaiah, Reaiah capa Baal.
013	1CH	005	006	Baal capa Beerah. Ahni teh Reuben e khobawi lah ao eiteh, Assyria siangpahrang Tiglathpileser ni san lah a hrawi.
013	1CH	005	007	Amae a nawngha Jeiel hoi Zekhariah, ahnimouh roi teh ca catoun separuinae pakhumnae dawkvah, imthungnaw kahrawikung lah ao.
013	1CH	005	008	Azaz capa Bela, Shema capa Azaz, Joel capa Shema ni Aroer hoi Nebo Baalmeon totouh kho a sak.
013	1CH	005	009	Kanîtholah Euphrates palang hoi kahrawng thung kâennae totouh, a coe awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Gilead ram dawk saringnaw hah a pungdaw toe.
013	1CH	005	010	Sawl se navah Hagri miphunnaw hoi a kâtuk awh teh, Gilead kanîtholah totouh, rimnaw dawk kho a sak awh.
013	1CH	005	011	Gad e casaknaw teh avangvanglah Bashan ram dawk Salkah totouh ao awh.
013	1CH	005	012	Bashan vah a lû lah Joel, apâhni lah Shapham, Janai hoi Shaphat tinaw doeh.
013	1CH	005	013	A na pa imthung hoi a hmaunawnghanaw Michael, Meshullam, Sheba, Jorai, Jakhan, Zia, Eber hoi sari touh a pha awh.
013	1CH	005	014	Hetnaw teh Huri capa Abihail e capanaw doeh. Ahni teh Jaorah capa doeh. Gilead capa, Michael capa, Jeshishai capa, Jahdo capa, Buz capa lah ao.
