013	1CH	005	017	Hote hnonaw pueng teh, Judah siangpahrang Jotham e se hoi Isarel siangpahrang Jeroboam e se teh setouknae dawk thut lah ao toe.
013	1CH	005	018	Reuben casak, Gad casak, hoi Manasseh miphun tangawn dawk hoi tarankahawinaw, bahling, tahloi ka patuem thai e naw, likathoumnaw, taran ka tuk thai e naw 44, 760 touh a pha awh.
013	1CH	005	019	Hatnavah, Hagri, Jetur, Naphish hoi Nodabnaw hoi a kâtuk awh.
013	1CH	005	020	Kâtuk nahaiyah Cathut koe a hram awh teh, ama a kâuep awh dawkvah, ahnimouh teh a kabawp awh. Hatdawkvah, Hagrinaw hoi ahnimouh koe kaawm e abuemlah a kut dawk hoi a rungngang awh.
013	1CH	005	021	Saringnaw a man pouh awh teh, kalauk 50000, tu 250000, hoi la 2000 hoi tami 100000 a la awh.
013	1CH	005	022	Tarantuknae teh Cathut e lah ao dawkvah, tami moikapap a due awh. San toung totouh a onae hmuen koe ao awh.
013	1CH	005	023	Manasseh miphun tangawn teh, haw e ram dawk kho a sak awh. Bashan hoi Baalhermon hoi Senir hoi Hermon mon totouh tami teh a pungdaw awh.
013	1CH	005	024	Hetnaw heh a imthungnaw kahrawikung lah a o: Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah, Jahdiel. Ahnimanaw teh tami a thakaawme, min kamthang e, imthung kahrawikung lah ao awh.
013	1CH	005	025	Mintoenaw e Cathut koe yuemkamcu awh hoeh dawkvah, ahnimae hmaitung Cathut ni a raphoe teh, hote ram dawk e cathutnaw koe a kâyo awh.
013	1CH	005	026	Hottelah Isarel Cathut ni Assiria siangpahrang Pul, Assiria siangpahrang Tiglathpileser e lungthin a tho sak teh, Reuben hoi Gad, Manasseh miphun tangawn hah san lah a man awh teh, Halah, Habor, Hara tinaw hah Gozan palang a ceikhai awh teh atu totouh ao awh.
