013	1CH	006	024	Assir capa Tahath, Tahath capa Uriel, Uriel capa Uzziah, Uzziah capa Sawl.
013	1CH	006	025	Elkanah casaknaw teh: Amasai hoi Ahimoth.
013	1CH	006	026	Ahimoth capa Elkanah, Elkanah casaknaw teh: Elkanah capa Zuph, Zuph capa Nahath.
013	1CH	006	027	Nahath capa Eliab, Eliab capa Jeroham, Jeroham capa Elkanah.
013	1CH	006	028	Samuel casaknaw teh: a camin Joel, apâhni e teh Abijah doeh.
013	1CH	006	029	Merari casaknaw teh: Mahli capa Libni, Libni capa Shimei, Shimei capa Uzzah.
013	1CH	006	030	Uzzah capa Shimea, Shimea capa Haggiah, Haggiah capa Asaiah.
013	1CH	006	031	Hetnaw teh lawkkam thingkong a ta hnukkhu, BAWIPA e im dawk kahrawikung hanelah Devit ni a ta e naw lah ao.
013	1CH	006	032	Solomon ni Jerusalem BAWIPA im a sak hoehroukrak, kamkhuengnae lukkareiim dawk la hoi thaw a tawk awh. A huhu lahoi thaw tawk a kâhlai awh.
