013	1CH	006	047	Mahli capa Shemer, Mushi capa Mahli, Merari capa Mushi, Levih capa Merari.
013	1CH	006	048	A hmaunawnghanaw thung dawk e Levih imthungnaw teh, Cathut onae lukkareiim dawk thaw ka tawk hanelah poe e lah ao awh.
013	1CH	006	049	Aron e casaknaw ni Cathut e san Mosi ni kâ a poe e naw pueng teh, hmuen kathoungpounge koe thaw tawk hane a coe awh. Isarelnaw yontha hanelah sathei hoi hmuitui hah hmaisawi thuengnae khoungroe dawk ouk a poe awh.
013	1CH	006	050	Aron casaknaw teh: Aron capa Eleazar, Eleazar capa Phinehas, Phinehas capa Abishua.
013	1CH	006	051	Abishua capa Bukki, Bukki capa Uzzi, Uzzi capa Zerahiah.
013	1CH	006	052	Zerahiah capa Meraioth, Meraioth capa Amariah, Amariah capa Ahitub.
013	1CH	006	053	Ahitub capa Zadok, Zadok capa Ahimaaz.
013	1CH	006	054	Hetnaw teh amamae ram thung a onae hmuen a nepnae koe lengkaleng kho a sak awh. Aron e capa Kohath miphunnaw teh, cungpam a khoe awh e patetlah,
013	1CH	006	055	Judah ram hoi Hebron hoi a tengpam e pueng hah poe e lah ao awh.
013	1CH	006	056	Hateiteh, khopui hoi a tengpam e ramnaw hoi khotenaw teh Jephunneh e capa Kaleb hah a poe awh.
013	1CH	006	057	Aron capanaw teh, kângue e khopui, Hebron, Libnah hoi a tengpam hai, Jattir hoi Eshtemoa tengpam e khonaw hai.
