013	1CH	012	013	A hra e teh Jeremiah, a hlaibun e teh Makhbannai.
013	1CH	012	014	Hetnaw teh Gad casaknaw thung hoi e doeh. Ahnimouh thung dawk hoi a thakayoun e tami 100 tabang ao. A thakaawme 1000 tabang ao.
