013	1CH	012	031	Manasseh casak tangawn dawk hoi Devit siangpahrang lah ao thai nahane ka tho e naw teh 18, 000 touh a pha.
013	1CH	012	032	Issakhar capa tueng navah, ka panuek thai e hoi, Isarel ni bangmaw a sak hane telah ka panuek thai e, kahrawikung 200 touh a pha. A hmaunawngha abuemlah amae uknae rahim vah ao awh.
013	1CH	012	033	Zebulun imthungnaw dawk hoi taran ka tuk thai e, senehmaica ka patuem ni teh ka bouk thai e 50, 000 a pha awh teh lungthin kacue e lah ao awh.
013	1CH	012	034	Naphtalinaw imthung hoi ransa ka hrawi e 1, 000 touh, saiphei, tahroe ka patuem e 37, 000 touh a pha.
013	1CH	012	035	Dan imthung dawk hoi senehmaica ka patuem e 28, 600 touh a pha.
