018	JOB	041	017	Hotnaw teh buet touh hoi buet touh koung kâkuet teh, kapek thai lah awm hoeh.
018	JOB	041	018	A hâ tangawn ni angnae a tâco sak teh, a mit hah kho nueng kadai e patetlah ao.
018	JOB	041	019	A kâko hoi hmaito angnae a tâco teh, hmaitali a tangpei.
018	JOB	041	020	A hnawng dawk hoi hmaikhunaw a tâco teh, moi thawngnae hlaam dawk ka tangdawk e hoi, ka kang e buruk patetlah ao.
018	JOB	041	021	A kâha ni hmaisaeinaw a kak teh, a pahni dawk hoi hmaito a tâco.
018	JOB	041	022	A lahuen dawk thaonae ao teh, a hmalah lungmathoenae hah a len.
018	JOB	041	023	A takthai hoi tharuinaw teh khakkâkuet teh, kâtahruet thai hoeh e kacakpounge lah ao.
018	JOB	041	024	A lungthin teh talung patetlah a te, Cakang phawmnae a rahim lae talung patetlah a te.
018	JOB	041	025	A thaw torei teh, athakaawme taminaw ni a taki awh, a thao e a taki awh dawkvah, ka pathu e patetlah ao awh.
018	JOB	041	026	Ahni koe tahloi ka phat nakunghai tâ thai mahoeh, pala, tahroe ni hai tâ thai mahoeh.
018	JOB	041	027	Sum hah cakong patetlah a pouk, rahum hah thingke patetlah a pouk.
018	JOB	041	028	Licung ni yawng sak thai mahoeh, Talung hoi dêi e hah ahni hanelah teh cakongkung patetlah ao.
018	JOB	041	029	Bongpai hah cakong patetlah a pouk teh, pala dawk hoi duenae hah koe a panuikhai.
018	JOB	041	030	A vonpui vuen hah kahran poung e hlaam kâbawng e patetlah doeh a o, tangdong um vah cangkatin e seh patetlah a tabo.
018	JOB	041	031	Ka dungpoung e tui hah hlaam patetlah a tangdo sak teh, talî kadung poung e hah satuium patetlah a sak.
018	JOB	041	032	A cei tangcoungnae dawk angnae hah a hruek teh, tami ni a dungpoung ati e tui hah sampo patetlah a pouk.
018	JOB	041	033	Takinae tawn laipalah, sak e lah ao teh, talai van dawk ahni patetlae awm hoeh.
018	JOB	041	034	Ka rasang poung e hno pueng hah a khet nah, ahni teh kâoup e catoun pueng dawk siangpahrang doeh telah a ti.
018	JOB	042	001	Hottelah Job ni BAWIPA hah a pathung teh hettelah a dei.
018	JOB	042	002	Bangpuengpa na sak thai tie hah ka panue, na noenae hah ngang thai lah awm hoeh.
018	JOB	042	003	Apimaw kaie panuenae laipalah khokhangnae ka hrawk e hah telah na pacei. kai hanelah kângairu poung e lah, ka panue hoeh e ka pâpha e lah ao hah ma.
018	JOB	042	004	Pahren lahoi thai nateh, lawk na dei sak haw. Lawk na pacei vaiteh na pathung haw telah na ti.
018	JOB	042	005	Nang teh hnâ hoi dueng doeh na thai rah, hatei, atu teh ka mit hoi na hmu toe.
018	JOB	042	006	Hatdawkvah, kama hoi kama ka kâpanuet teh, hraba hoi vaiphu dawk ka tahung teh, pan ka kângai toe telah a ti.
018	JOB	042	007	BAWIPA ni Job koevah lawk be a dei hnukkhu, BAWIPA ni Teman tami Eliphaz koevah, nang hoi na hui roi koevah ka lungkhueknae a kâan. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka san Job patetlah kaie kong dawk, lawkkatang hah na dei awh hoeh.
018	JOB	042	008	Hatdawkvah, maitotan 7, tutan 7 hrawi nateh, ka san Job koevah cet awh nateh, nangmouh hanelah thuengnae hah poe awh. Hahoi ka san Job ni nangmouh hanelah a ratoum vaiteh, hote kai ni ka coe pouh han. Nahoeh pawiteh, na pathu awh e patetlah na lathueng lawk na ceng awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka san Job patetlah kaie kong dawkvah, lawkkatang na dei awh hoeh telah a ti.
018	JOB	042	009	Hottelah Teman tami Eliphaz hoi Shuhi tami Bildad hoi Naamath tami Zophar tinaw a cei awh teh, BAWIPA ni kâ a poe e patetlah a sak awh teh, BAWIPA ni Job kâheinae hah a coe pouh.
018	JOB	042	010	Hahoi Job ni a huinaw kathum touh hanelah, a ratoum pouh torei teh, BAWIPA ni Job kangduenae hmuen hah bout ahawi sak teh, BAWIPA ni Job teh yampa e a tawnta e hlakvah, let hni touh bout a poe.
018	JOB	042	011	Hottelah a hmaunawnghanaw hoi a tawncanunaw pueng teh, yampa kapanueknaw pueng ni a im dawk a tho awh teh, rawca a ca awh. BAWIPA ni a lathueng vah kathoute a phasak e naw pueng dawk a lungpahawi awh teh a lungmawng sak awh. Tami pueng ni ahni koevah, ngun hoi suinaw hah a poe awh.
018	JOB	042	012	Hottelah BAWIPA ni ahmaloe e hlak a hnukteng yawhawinae kapap poung lah a poe. Tu 14,000, kalauk 6,000, maitotan a bo lah 1,000, hoi la manu 1,000 a tawn.
018	JOB	042	013	Ca tongpa 7 touh hoi canu 3 touh hai a tawn.
018	JOB	042	014	Apasuekpoung e min teh Jemimah, apâhni e teh Keziah, apâthum e teh Kerenhappukh.
018	JOB	042	015	Ram thung pueng dawk Job e canu patetlah meikahawi e awm hoeh. A na pa ni ahnimouh teh a thangroinaw koe râw a rei van.
018	JOB	042	016	Hathnukkhu hoi Job teh kum 140 a hring teh a ca capanaw hoi a na mincanaw se pali totouh a hmu rah.
018	JOB	042	017	Hottelah Job a matawng teh hnintha kuep lahoi a due.
#
# BOOK	019	PSA	Psalms	Sam
019	PSA	001	001	Kasakkung: Panuekhoeh Tamikathoutnaw e khokhangnae koe ka cet hoeh e tami, tamikayonnaw e lamthung dawk kangdout hoeh e tami, kadudamnaw e kamkhuengnae koe hai ka tahung hoeh e tami,
019	PSA	001	002	BAWIPA e lawk ka ngâi niteh, a kâlawknaw hah karum khodai luepluep ka pouk e tami teh a yawhawi.
019	PSA	001	003	Ahni teh tui teng vah ung e, a tue a pha torei ka paw niteh, a hna hai kamyai hoeh e thingkung hoi a kâvan. A tawksak e naw dawk hawinae a hmu han.
019	PSA	001	004	Tamikathoutnaw teh, hottelah laipalah, kahlî ni a palek e cahik hoi a kâvan awh.
019	PSA	001	005	Hatdawkvah, tamikathoutnaw teh, lawkcengnae hnin navah kangdout thai awh mahoeh. Tamikayonnaw hai tami kalannaw e kamkhuengnae dawk bawk thai mahoeh.
019	PSA	001	006	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni tami kalannaw e lamthung teh a panue. Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung teh rawknae koe a pha han.
019	PSA	002	001	Kathutkung: Devit Miphunnaw teh bangkongmaw ruengruengti awh. Tamimaya teh bangkongmaw ayawmyin hno a sak awh.
019	PSA	002	002	BAWIPA hoi Messiah taran lahoi, talai bawinaw cungtalah a kamkhueng awh teh, lawkcengkungnaw cungtalah kho a khang awh.
019	PSA	002	003	Tho awh. A kâkateknae naw hah ratham pouh sei. Kâkateknae rui hah tâkhawng pouh sei.
019	PSA	002	004	Kalvan ka tahung e ni panuikhai vaiteh, Bawipa ni panuilai lah a sak han.
019	PSA	002	005	Hahoi, lungkhuek laihoi ahnimouh koe lawk dei vaiteh, puenghoi a lungrei a thaisak han.
019	PSA	002	006	Hateiteh, kaie mon kathoung Zion vah, ka siangpahrang ka ta toe.
019	PSA	002	007	BAWIPA ni nang teh ka Capa doeh. Sahnin vah na khe telah kai koe a dei e hah ka pâpho han.
019	PSA	002	008	Kai koe het haw. Râw lah miphunnaw na poe vaiteh, talai pout ditouh na coe hanelah na poe han.
019	PSA	002	009	Sumtaboung hoi na uk vaiteh, talai hlaamkabokung ni a hem e patetlah rek na hem han.
019	PSA	002	010	Hatdawkvah, Oe siangpahrangnaw, na lungang awh leih. Talai lawkcengkungnaw yuenae kâhmo awh haw.
019	PSA	002	011	Taki laihoi BAWIPA thaw tawk awh haw. Pâyaw laihoi konawm awh.
019	PSA	002	012	Capa teh pahnuem awh. Hoehpawiteh, a lungkhuek payon vaih. Dongdeng a lungphuen toteh, lam vah koung na kahmat payon vaih. Ama kâuep e pueng teh tami yawkahawi e doeh.
019	PSA	003	001	Kathutkung: Devit, Devit ni a sak e la: A capa Absalom koehoi a yawng nah sak e Oe BAWIPA, kaie tarannaw teh apap poung. Kai na ka tarannaw apap poung.
019	PSA	003	002	Taminaw ni, ahni teh Cathut koehoi e kabawpnae awmhoeh telah kai hanelah a dei awh. (Selah)
019	PSA	003	003	Hatei, Oe BAWIPA, nang teh kai hanlah kânguenae bahling, kaie bawilennae lah na o teh, kaie lû katawmkung lah na o.
019	PSA	003	004	Kai ni hram laihoi, BAWIPA hah ka kaw toteh, ahni ni kathounge mon dawk hoi kai hah na pato. (Selah)
019	PSA	003	005	BAWIPA ni na kabawp dawkvah, kai teh ka i thai teh, ka kâhlaw thai.
019	PSA	003	006	Kai hah avoivang lahoi na kalup niteh, na ka tuk e tami thong hra touh ka phat hai ka taket hoeh.
019	PSA	003	007	Oe BAWIPA, thaw haw. Kaie Cathut, na rungngang haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang ni ka tarannaw pueng e kamhru hah, na hem pouh teh, tamikathoutnaw e a hâ hah na khoe pouh.
019	PSA	003	008	Rungngangnae teh BAWIPA e doeh. Nange yawhawinae teh, na taminaw koe phat lawiseh. (Selah)
019	PSA	004	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe lannae Cathut, na kaw toteh na thai pouh haw. Ka runae hah na hlai haw. Na pahren haw, ka ratoumnae hah na thai pouh haw.
019	PSA	004	002	Oe tami capanaw, ka bawilennae hah nâtotouh maw kayanae lah na coung sak awh han. Nâtotouh maw ayawmyin hno hah na lungpataw awh vaiteh, payonnae hah na tawng awh han. (Selah)
019	PSA	004	003	BAWIPA ni cathutlae tami teh a rawi tie hah panuek awh haw. Ka kaw toteh BAWIPA ni na thai pouh han.
019	PSA	004	004	Na lungkhuek yawkaw, yonnae teh sak hanh. Na ikhun dawk na lung hoi pouk nateh duem awm.
019	PSA	004	005	Lannae thuengnae hah poe nateh, BAWIPA hah kâuep haw.
019	PSA	004	006	Apinimaw hawinae na hmusak han na ka tet pouh e moi ao awh. BAWIPA kaimouh koe na minhmai angnae hoi na tue haw.
019	PSA	004	007	Cakang hoi misur moikapap a hmu awh dawk konawmnae hlak kalenhnawn e konawmnae hah ka lung thung na ta toe.
019	PSA	004	008	Duem ka yan vaiteh, ka i han toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Oe BAWIPA, nang ni dueng doeh karoumcalah na o sak thai.
019	PSA	005	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe BAWIPA, ka lawk na thai pouh haw. Ka khopouknae hah na pouk pouh haw.
019	PSA	005	002	Ka siangpahrang hoi ka Cathut, ka hramnae hah na thai pouh haw. Nang koevah, ka ratoum.
019	PSA	005	003	Oe BAWIPA, amom vah, ka lawk na thai han. Amom vah nang koe lah kangvawi laihoi, lathueng lah ka khet han.
019	PSA	005	004	Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh thoenae dawk a lung kahawi e Cathut nahoeh. Thoenae hai nang koe awm hoeh.
019	PSA	005	005	Na hmithmu vah kâoupnaw teh kangdout thai mahoeh. Payonnae ka sak e pueng teh na hmuhma.
019	PSA	005	006	Laithoe kadeinaw hah na raphoe teh, dumyennae hoi tami theikahrannaw hah Bawipa ni a panuet.
019	PSA	005	007	Hatei kai teh, na lungmanae apap kecu dawk na im vah ka tho han. Nang taki laihoi kathounge Bawkim koelah kangvawi laihoi na bawk han.
019	PSA	005	008	Oe BAWIPA, ka tarannaw kecu dawk na lannae hoi na hrawi haw, ka hmalah na lam hah lan sak haw.
019	PSA	005	009	Bangkongtetpawiteh, a pahni dawk yuemkamcunae awmhoeh. Athung lae teh rawknae doeh. A lawkron teh kamawng e tangkom doeh. A laihoi dueng doeh ayânaw a oup awh.
019	PSA	005	010	Oe Cathut, yon pen haw. Amamouh ni a sak awh e dawk letlang bawt awh naseh. Kâtapoenae moipap dawkvah, tâkhawng haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang taran laihoi taran a thaw awh.
019	PSA	005	011	Hatei, nang ka kâuep e pueng, konawm awh naseh. Na ngue dawkvah, konawm laihoi hram awh naseh. Na min ka lungpataw naw hai nang dawk konawm awh naseh.
019	PSA	005	012	Bangtelane Oe BAWIPA, tamikalan yawhawi na poe vaiteh, minhmai kahawi hoi bahling patetlah na ramuk han.
019	PSA	006	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe BAWIPA, lungkhuek laihoi na yue hanh, na lungphuen laihoi na yue hanh.
019	PSA	006	002	Oe BAWIPA, na pahren haw. Ka tha a youn. Oe BAWIPA, na dam sak haw. Ka hrunaw teh runae a kâhmo toe.
019	PSA	006	003	Ka hringnae hai a ru toe. Oe BAWIPA, nâsittouh maw na ro han.
019	PSA	006	004	Oe BAWIPA, bout ban nateh, na rungngang haw. Oe na lungmanae hoi na rungngang haw.
019	PSA	006	005	Bangkongtetpawiteh, duenae koehoi nang pouknae awmhoeh, apinimouh phuen koehoi lunghawinae lawk a dei han.
019	PSA	006	006	Ka cingounae koe ka tâwn. Kho pei ka dai lah ka ikhun dawk ka ka teh, ka mitphi ni lahoung koung a duk sak.
019	PSA	006	007	Lungmathoenae kecu dawk ka mit koung a ro teh, ka tarannaw kecu dawk a mawm toe.
019	PSA	006	008	Payonnae kasaknaw pueng, na cettakhai awh leih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni ka kanae lawk hai a thai.
019	PSA	006	009	BAWIPA ni ka kâheinae hah a thai toe. BAWIPA ni ka ratoumnae hah a dâw han.
019	PSA	006	010	Ka taran pueng kaya laihoi ru awh naseh. Ban awh naseh, vaitalahoi kayak awh naseh.
019	PSA	007	001	Kathutkung: Devit, Devit teh Benjamin tami Kush e lawk kecu dawk BAWIPA hmalah a sak e la Oe BAWIPA, ka Cathut, nang teh na kâuep. Na ka pacekpahlek e pueng koehoi na rungngang nateh na hlout sak haw.
019	PSA	007	002	Hoehpawiteh, sendek patetlah na kei vaiteh, rungngangkung ao hoehnahlan vah, na paset awh han doeh.
019	PSA	007	003	Oe BAWIPA ka Cathut, kai ni hottelah ka sak vaiteh, ka kut dawk payonnae kaawm nakunghai,
019	PSA	007	004	Kai koe duem kaawm e hah thoenae hoi ka patho teh, ka tarannaw hah a khuekhaw awm laipalah ka coungroe pawiteh,
019	PSA	007	005	taran ni na pâlei naseh, na phat naseh. Kahringnae hah talai dawk repcoungroe awh naseh. Minhmai barinae hah vaiphu dawk tat awh naseh. (Selah)
019	PSA	007	006	Oe BAWIPA, lungkhuek laihoi thaw haw, ka tarannaw e lungkhueknae hah ngang haw. Kâ na poe tangcoung patetlah kai han lawkceng hanlah thaw haw.
019	PSA	007	007	Miphunnaw kamkhueng awh vaiteh, nang hah na kalup awh han. Ahnimouh hanlah arasangnae koe ban haw.
019	PSA	007	008	BAWIPA ni lawk a ceng han. Oe BAWIPA, ka lannae hoi ka thung kaawm e yuemkamcu lah ka o e patetlah lawk na ceng haw.
019	PSA	007	009	Oe tamikathoutnaw, thoenae teh poutsak lah awm lawiseh. Hatei, lannae teh caksak lah awm seh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka lan e Cathut ni lungthin hoi pouknae hah ouk a tanouk.
019	PSA	007	010	Lungthin kalannaw rungngangkung Cathut teh kai kânguenae lah ao.
019	PSA	007	011	Cathut teh kalan e lawkcengkung lah ao teh, Cathut teh tamikathoutnaw koe hnintangkuem a lungkhuek.
019	PSA	007	012	Pankângai hoehpawiteh, a tahloi hah kata vaiteh, licung hah sawn vaiteh, coungkacoe lah ao han.
019	PSA	007	013	Duenae senehmaica hai ahni hanlah a rakueng teh, hmai kang thai e samtang hah a sak awh.
019	PSA	007	014	Tamikathout ni yonnae hah a khe. Runae hah a vawn teh laithoe ouk a khe.
019	PSA	007	015	Tangkom kadungpoung lah a tai teh, a tai e tangkom dawk ama letlang a bo.
019	PSA	007	016	A sak e runae hah amae lû van bout ban vaiteh, a tâcosak e thoenae teh amae lû van bout a pha han.
019	PSA	007	017	BAWIPA teh a lan e patetlah ka pholen han. Lathueng Poung BAWIPA min pholen hoi la ka sak han.
019	PSA	008	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe kaimae Bawipa, Jehovah teh, talai van pueng dawk na min ahawi toungloung. Na bawilennae teh kalvannaw lathueng vah na ta.
019	PSA	008	002	Bangkongtetpawiteh, na tarannaw kecu dawk moipathungkung hoi taran na roum sak thai nahanlah, sanu ka net e camonaw pahni dawk hoi thaonae hah na cak sak.
019	PSA	008	003	Na kutdawn hoi na sak e kalvannaw hoi na caksak e thapa hoi âsinaw hah ka khet navah,
019	PSA	008	004	tami heh banglamouh ao teh, na lungthung hoi na pouk. Tami capa heh banglamouh ao teh khuet na pai sin.
019	PSA	008	005	Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni hah kalvantaminaw hlak bet ka rahnoum lah na sak teh, bawilennae hoi pholennae hah na kâmuk sak.
019	PSA	008	006	Na kutsaknaw koe kâ na tawn sak teh, a khok rahim bangpuengpa na hruek pouh.
019	PSA	008	007	Maitotan hoi tu pueng hai, kahrawngum e saring pueng hoi,
019	PSA	008	008	kalvan e tavanaw hoi, talî thung e tanganaw hoi, talaipui thung kaawm e pueng hoi,
019	PSA	008	009	Oe BAWIPA, kaimae Bawipa, talai van pueng dawk na min teh ahawi toungloung.
019	PSA	009	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe BAWIPA, ka lungthin abuemlahoi na pholen han. Na sak e kângairu hno pueng ka dei han.
019	PSA	009	002	Nang dawk konawm lahoi ka nawm han. Oe Lathueng Poung, na min pholen hoi la ka sak han.
019	PSA	009	003	Ka tarannaw a ban awh toteh, na hmalah tâlaw awh naseh, rawk awh naseh.
019	PSA	009	004	Bangkongtetpawiteh, bawitungkhung dawk tahung hoi lannae hoi lawk na ceng teh, ka lannae hoi coungnae hah na cak sak.
019	PSA	009	005	Miphunnaw hah na yue teh, tamikathoutnaw hah na raphoe teh, ahnimae min teh ayungyoe hoi a yungyoe totouh na raphoe toe.
019	PSA	009	006	Oe ka tarannaw, rawknae teh a yungyoe poutnae koe a pha toe. Khopui teh na raphoe teh noutnae ao hoeh totouh a kahma toe.
019	PSA	009	007	Hatei, BAWIPA teh a yungyoe a kangning. Lawkceng nahanelah bawitungkhung teh a rakueng toe.
019	PSA	009	008	Lannae lahoi talaivan heh lawkceng vaiteh, a lannae dawk lawkcengnae hah taminaw hanelah a cak sak.
019	PSA	009	009	BAWIPA teh repcoungroenaw hane lahai rapanim lah ao teh, runae kâhmo nah kâhronae lah ao han.
019	PSA	009	010	Na min kapanueknaw ni nang na kâuep awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA, nang katawngnaw teh na cettakhai boihoeh.
019	PSA	009	011	Zion kaawm e naw, BAWIPA pholen hoi la sak awh. A sak e hno hah taminaw koe pâpho awh.
019	PSA	009	012	Thipaling phu moi a pathung toteh, pahnim hoeh. Kârahnoumnaw e hram lawk hai pahnim hoeh.
019	PSA	009	013	Oe BAWIPA, na pahren haw. Na kahmuhmanaw kecu dawk ka runae hah pouk haw. Nang teh duenae longkha thung hoi na kahloutsakkung doeh.
019	PSA	009	014	Hottelah, nang pholennae pueng hah, Zion canu longkha koehoi roeroe ka pâpho thai nahanlah, na rungngangnae dawk ka konawm han.
019	PSA	009	015	Miphunnaw teh amamouh ni a tai awh e tangkom dawk koung a bo awh. Arulahoi a patung awh e tangkam dawk a khok a kâman awh.
019	PSA	009	016	BAWIPA teh lawk a ceng e patetlah panue thai. Tamikathoutnaw teh amamouh ni a sak e hno dawk a kâman awh.
019	PSA	009	017	Tamikathoutnaw teh Cathut ka pahnim e miphunnaw hoi sheol dawk a kak awh han.
019	PSA	009	018	Bangkongtetpawiteh, kavoutthoupnaw teh pahnim lah pou awm awh mahoeh. Karoedengnaw, e ngaihawinae hai pou kahmat mahoeh.
019	PSA	009	019	Oe BAWIPA thaw haw, tami ni na tâ hanh naseh. Miphunnaw teh na mithmu vah lawkceng lah awm awh naseh.
019	PSA	009	020	Oe BAWIPA, miphunnaw ni tami lah ao awh e a panue awh nahanelah, lungpuennae dawk tat haw. (Selah)
019	PSA	010	001	Kathutkung: Panuekhoeh Oe BAWIPA, bangkongmaw ahlanae koe na kangdue. Bangkongmaw runae tueng nah na kâhro.
019	PSA	010	002	Tamikathoutnaw ni kâoupnae lahoi tami karoedengnaw hah a rektap awh. A sak awh e ni amamouh letlang man naseh.
019	PSA	010	003	Tamikathoutnaw teh amamae lungngainae dawk ouk a kâoup awh. Kahounlounnaw ni BAWIPA a hnoun awh teh, a dudam awh.
019	PSA	010	004	Tamikathoutnaw ni kâoupnae lahoi Cathut tawng ngai awh hoeh. A pouknae dawkvah, Cathut awm hoeh ati awh.
019	PSA	010	005	Lawkcengnae teh ahni hoi ahla arasang dawkvah, a tarannaw pueng hah a dudam.
019	PSA	010	006	A lungthung hoi, kâhuen mahoeh, nâtuek hai runae kâhmo mahoeh telah a pouk.
019	PSA	010	007	A pahni teh thoebonae, dumnae hoi repcoungroenae lawk hoi akawi. A lai rahim vah runae hoi payonnae teh ao.
019	PSA	010	008	Kho tangkuem lampawp koe a tahung teh, tami ni hmuhoehnae koe yonnae ka tawn hoeh e naw hah a thei awh. Tami ka roedeng e hah arulahoi a pawp awh.
019	PSA	010	009	Sendek ni a kâkhu dawk hoi a pawp e patetlah arulahoi tami ouk a pawp. Tami ka roedeng hah man hanlah a pawp. A tamlawk hoi a sawn toteh tami ka roedeng a kâman.
019	PSA	010	010	Hottelah, karoedengnaw hah a thaonae lahoi rawp sak nahanlah, ka rahnoumca lah a tabo awh.
019	PSA	010	011	A lungthung hoi, Cathut ni a pahnim toe. A minhmai hai a hro toe. Nâtuek hai hmawt mahoeh toe telah a pouk.
019	PSA	010	012	Oe BAWIPA, thaw haw. Oe Cathut, na kut dâw haw. Kârahnoumnaw hah pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	010	013	Bangkongmaw tamikathoutnaw ni Cathut banglahai a noutna awh hoeh. A lungthung hoi, banglah pouk mahoeh ouk ati awh.
019	PSA	010	014	Hateiteh, lungreithai hoi runae teh na pakhingpalang teh, na kut hoi moipathung hanlah na hmu toe. Karoedengnaw, teh nang koe a kâhnawng awh teh, nang teh, na pa ka tawn hoeh naw kabawmkung lah na o.
019	PSA	010	015	Tamikathoutnaw hoi tamikayonnaw e kut hah khoe pouh nateh, ceitakhai e awm laipalah, hawihoehnae pueng koung pâphue pouh haw.
019	PSA	010	016	BAWIPA teh a yungyoe hoi a yungyoe totouh siangpahrang doeh. A ram thung hoi miphunnaw koung a kahma awh.
019	PSA	010	017	Repcoungroe e hoi na pa ka tawn hoeh naw koevah, kângingnae sak hanelah, talai taminaw ni repcoungroe hoeh nahanelah,
019	PSA	010	018	BAWIPA, kârahnoumnaw e ngainae teh na panue teh, ahnimouh lawkceng hanelah na hnâ teh na pakeng pouh.
019	PSA	011	001	Kathutkung: Devit BAWIPA dawk ka kâuep. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka hringnae koevah, na monsom vah tavaca patetlah kamleng telah na dei thai.
019	PSA	011	002	Bangtelah tetpawiteh, na khenhaw! Tamikathoutnaw ni licung a sawn awh teh, lungthin kalannaw arulahoi ka hanelah, lirui dawk pala coungkacoe a mawp awh toe.
019	PSA	011	003	Adunaw hah raphoe lah awm pawiteh, tamikalan ni bangmouh a sak thai han.
019	PSA	011	004	BAWIPA teh kathounge Bawkim dawk ao teh, BAWIPA bawitungkhung teh kalvan vah ao. A mit hoi a khet teh, tami capanaw teh a mitlakhuem hoi a tanouk.
019	PSA	011	005	BAWIPA ni tamikalan hah ouk a tanouk. Hatei, tamikathout hoi thama lah kalawmnaw teh, a hringnae hoi a hmuhma.
019	PSA	011	006	Tamikathoutnaw koe hmaisaan hmaito a rak sak vaiteh, hmai hoi gan hoi hmaikahlî teh a coe awh hane manang lah ao han.
019	PSA	011	007	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA teh a lan. Lannae hah lung a pataw teh, tamikalan teh a khet.
019	PSA	012	001	Kathutkung: Devit BAWIPA na kabawm haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, cathutlae tami awm hoeh toe. Tami capanaw dawk yuemkamcu e awm hoeh toe.
019	PSA	012	002	A imrinaw hoi laithoe lawk a kâdei awh teh, lungsamphei laihoi lawk a dei awh.
019	PSA	012	003	BAWIPA ni pasawtpanepnae pahni hoi, kâoupnae lai hah tâtueng naseh.
019	PSA	012	004	Ahnimouh ni, ka lai hoi ka tâ han. Ka pahni hai kama e doeh. Apimouh kaimouh lathueng ka bawi han telah ati awh.
019	PSA	012	005	BAWIPA ni, repcoungroe e tami ka roedeng e hoi, voutthoup laihoi kacingounaw hanlah, atu ka thaw vaiteh, a ngaihawi awh e roumnae hmuen koe ka o sak han telah ati.
019	PSA	012	006	BAWIPA e lawknaw teh, ka thoung e lawk doeh. Talai hoi thoung sak nahanelah, hmai dawk vai sari touh sôlêi tangcoung e ngun patetlah ao.
019	PSA	012	007	Oe BAWIPA, nang ni na khetyawt. Hete senaw thung dawk hoi a yungyoe na roum sak.
019	PSA	012	008	Tami capanaw ni tamikapo a tawmrasang awh toteh, tamikathoutnaw teh hmuen tangkuem a kâva awh.
019	PSA	013	001	Kathutkung: Devit Oe BAWIPA, nâtotouh maw na pahnim yungyoe han. Nâtotouh maw kai koehoi na minhmai na hro han rah.
019	PSA	013	002	Kai teh, ka lung pou a mathoe. Nâtotouh ne kamadueng lungreithai hoi ka i han vai. Nâtotouh ne ka lathueng ka taran ni a kâoup han rah vai.
019	PSA	013	003	Oe BAWIPA ka Cathut, kangvawi nateh ka lawk hah na thai pouh haw. Ka mit ang sak haw. Hoehpawiteh, duenae patetlah ka ip payon vaih.
019	PSA	013	004	Hoehpawiteh, ka taran ni ahni ka tâ toe ati han doeh. Hoehpawiteh, ka kâroe navah, runae na kapoenaw a konawm awh langvaih.
019	PSA	013	005	Hatei, na lungmanae hah ka kâuep teh, na rungngangnae dawk ka lungthin a konawm han.
019	PSA	013	006	BAWIPA koe la ka sak han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka lathueng ahawi tangngak.
019	PSA	014	001	Kathutkung: Devit Tamipathu ni a lungthung hoi, Cathut awmhoeh ati. A rawk toe. Panuet ka tho e hno doeh a sak. Hawinae ka sak e awm hoeh toe.
019	PSA	014	002	Cathut ka tawng niteh, ka panuek thai e ao han na ou tie panue han ngai dawk, BAWIPA ni kalvan hoi tami capanaw hah a khet cathuk.
019	PSA	014	003	Abuemlahoi lam a phen awh teh, cungtalah koung a rawk awh toe. Hawinae kasakkung apihai awmhoeh. Buet touh boehai awmhoeh.
019	PSA	014	004	Payonnae kasaknaw ni panuenae tawn awh hoeh ma aw. Rawca ca e patetlah ka taminaw hah a ca awh teh, BAWIPA kaw awh hoeh.
019	PSA	014	005	Hawvah, takinae kalen koe ao awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut teh tami kalannaw koelah ao.
019	PSA	014	006	Tami karoedengnaw e pouknae teh a kaya sak awh. Hatei, BAWIPA teh ahnimae kânguenae doeh.
019	PSA	014	007	Oe Isarel rungngangnae teh Zion hoi tâcawt naseh. BAWIPA ni san lah kaawm e taminaw a bankhai toteh, Jakop teh konawm naseh. Isarel hai lunghawi naseh.
019	PSA	015	001	Kathutkung: Devit BAWIPA, na lukkareiim dawk apimouh kangning han. Na mon kathoung dawk apimouh kaawm han.
019	PSA	015	002	Kângingnae hoi ka hring niteh, lannae a sak laihoi a lung hoi lawkkatang ka dei niteh,
019	PSA	015	003	a lai hoi tamthoe ka dei boihoeh niteh, a imri lathueng thoenae sak laipalah, a huinaw min hai ka pathoe boihoeh niteh,
