019	PSA	063	006	Ka ikhun dawk hoi ka pouk navah, karumsaning totouh ouk ka pouk.
019	PSA	063	007	Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh na kabawmkung doeh. Hatdawkvah, na rathei rahim vah ka konawm han.
