019	PSA	066	005	Tho awh nateh Cathut ni sak e naw hah khenhaw. Tami capanaw hanelah, a sak e naw hah kângairu hanelah ao.
019	PSA	066	006	Ama ni talîpui hah talai kaphui lah a coung sak teh, talîpui dawk khok hoi a cei awh. Hawvah ama dawk a konawm awh.
019	PSA	066	007	A thaonae hoi pou a uk, A mit hoi miphun pueng hah a khet. Tarankathawnaw teh kâphokâlen awh hanh naseh. (Selah)
019	PSA	066	008	Oe tamimaya, maimae Cathut teh pholen awh haw. Pholennae lawk heh thai kamcu lah sak awh.
