019	PSA	073	007	A thâw awh lawi vah, a mitkatueng awh. A pouk awh e hlak ka paphnawn a tawn awh.
019	PSA	073	008	Repcoungroenae hah a panuikhai awh teh, kâoupnae lawk a dei awh.
019	PSA	073	009	A lawk dei e ni kalvan totouh a taran teh, a lai ni talai pueng a katin.
019	PSA	073	010	Hatdawkvah, a taminaw teh ahnimouh koe a ban awh teh, tui moikapap e hah koung a nei awh.
019	PSA	073	011	Bangtelah hoi maw Cathut ni a panue. Lathueng Poung dawk panuenae ao maw telah ati awh.
019	PSA	073	012	Khenhaw! hetnaw heh Cathut ka bari hoeh e, banghai pouk laipalah ka hring e lah ao awh teh, hoehoe a tawnta awh.
019	PSA	073	013	Ka lungthin kathoung sak nakunghai, atangcalah cungkeihoeh. Yon thuengnae lahoi ka kut ka pâsu nakunghai cungkeihoeh.
019	PSA	073	014	Hnin tangkuem tarawknae hoi amom karoitawi yuenae doeh ka khang.
019	PSA	073	015	Hottelah ka dei han ka tet pawiteh, khenhaw! na catounnaw koe torei teh, tamikalan hoeh lah kaawm han.
019	PSA	073	016	Hetheh, thaipanuek nahanelah ka pouk torei teh, hothateh kai hanelah ka pataw katang e lah ao.
019	PSA	073	017	Cathut hmuen kathoung koe kâen toteh, ahnimouh poutnae heh ka thaipanuek katang toe.
019	PSA	073	018	Ahnimouh teh pâhnannae koe na ta teh, rawkphainae hmuen koe na tâkhawng.
019	PSA	073	019	Oe, bangtelah, tawkkadek dawk rawknae koe louk a pha awh vaw. Takitho e ni koung louk a ca awh vaw.
019	PSA	073	020	Kâhlaw toteh, karum mang patetlah, Bawipa na pâhlaw toteh, ahnimae meikaphawk hah na pacekpahlek pouh han.
019	PSA	073	021	Hot patetlah ka lungthin a pataw teh, ka pouknae hai a ru.
019	PSA	073	022	Panuenae ka tawn hoeh e hoi tamipathu lah ka o teh, na hmalah saring patetlah doeh ka o.
019	PSA	073	023	Hatei nakunghai, nang koe pou ka o teh, aranglae kut dawk na kuet pouh.
019	PSA	073	024	Na mae kâpankhainae lahoi lam na hrawi teh, hathnukkhu bawilennae hah na coe pouh.
019	PSA	073	025	Kalvan vah nang laipalah apimouh ka tawn. Talaivan hai nang laipalah, ka ngai e alouke awm hoeh toe.
019	PSA	073	026	Ka takthai hoi ka lungthin teh a tâwn. Hatei, Cathut teh, a yungyoe hoi ka lungthin thaonae hoi ham lah ao.
019	PSA	073	027	Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang hoi kâhlat e teh, kahmat awh roeroe han doeh. Nang koe kâyawt e pueng teh raphoe lah ao han.
019	PSA	073	028	Hateiteh, kai hanelah teh Cathut hnai e heh ahawi. Na sak e hno pueng heh ka kamnue sak thai nahanlah, Bawipa Jehovah dawk doeh ka kâuep toe.
019	PSA	074	001	Kathutkung: Asaph Oe Cathut bangkongmaw na pahnawt vaw. Bangkongmaw na saring a pânae koe e na tuhunaw taranlahoi na lungkhueknae hmaikhu a pâyam rah bo vaw.
019	PSA	074	002	Kamkhueng e tamimaya, yampa na ran e, râw lah na pang e miphun, na ratang e naw heh pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	074	003	Raphoe tangcoung e hmuen koe tho haw. Hmuen kathoung dawk e hno pueng hah taran ni koung a raphoe toe.
019	PSA	074	004	Na taminaw a kamkhuengnae hmuen koe, na tarannaw teh a hramki awh teh, mitnoutnaw hah a vo awh.
019	PSA	074	005	Ratu thing ka tâtueng hane patetlah, cakânaw teh a palik awh.
019	PSA	074	006	Dongdengca dawk bawkim hnonaw hah amamae cakâ, cakkinnaw hoi a raphoe awh.
019	PSA	074	007	Thoungnae hmuen hah hmai a sawi awh teh, na min onae hmuen hah a khin sak awh toe.
019	PSA	074	008	Koung raphoe awh sei ati awh teh, ram thung e Cathut bawknae hmuen pueng hah hmai koung a sawi awh.
019	PSA	074	009	Kaimouh teh mae mitnoutnae ka hmawt awh hoeh toe. Profet hai awm hoeh toe. Bangkong han nama aw, telah kapanuekkung kaimouh koe awm hoeh toe.
019	PSA	074	010	Oe Cathut, bangkongmaw na tarannaw ni na pathoe han. Taran ni na min pou a pacekpahlek han na maw.
019	PSA	074	011	Bangkongmaw na kut aranglae hah na dâw hoeh vaw. Bout dâw nateh, ahnimanaw hah koung raphoe haw.
019	PSA	074	012	Bangtelah tetpawiteh, Cathut teh ayan hoi talai taminaw koe rungngangnae kasakkung kaie Siangpahrang doeh.
019	PSA	074	013	Na thaonae lahoi talîpui hah na kapek teh, tui thung tuitamnaw e lû hah na khoe pouh.
019	PSA	074	014	Leviathan lû hah koung na khoe pouh teh, kahrawng kaawmnaw ni ca hanelah na poe.
019	PSA	074	015	Tuikhu hoi palangnaw hah na palang pouh teh, palangpuinaw hah na hak sak.
019	PSA	074	016	Khodai hoi karum hai nange doeh Kanî hoi angnae hah na sak toe.
019	PSA	074	017	Talai khori pueng hai thoseh, kompawi hoi kasik pueng hai thoseh na sak toe.
019	PSA	074	018	Oe BAWIPA, taran ni na pathoe e hoi tamipathunaw ni na min a pacekpahlek e hah pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	074	019	Oe, na bakhu hringnae heh sarang koe poe hanh. Ka mathoe e na taminaw e hringnae heh a yungyoe pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	074	020	Lawkkam hah bari haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, talai a hmonae hmuennaw hah rektap lawpnae hoi akawi.
019	PSA	074	021	Oe, repcoungroe e naw heh, kaya laihoi ban sak hanh. Mathoe hoi a reikathainaw ni na min pholen naseh.
019	PSA	074	022	Oe Cathut, thaw nateh, na kong hah kangdoutkhai haw. Tamipathu ni hnintangkuem na pathoe e hah pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	074	023	Na tarannaw lawk heh pahnim hanh. Nang na ka tarannaw e ruengruengtinae lawk teh hoehoe a kampaw e hah pahnim hanh.
019	PSA	075	001	Kathutkung: Asaph Oe Cathut, nang koe lunghawi lawk ka dei, lunghawi lawk ka dei. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na sak e kângairu hnonaw ni na min a hnainae a kamnue sak.
019	PSA	075	002	Kâdawk e tueng a pha toteh, kânging lah lawk na ceng han.
019	PSA	075	003	Talai hoi a thung kaawm e naw pueng raphoe lah ao teh, a khom hah kacaklah a ung. (Selah)
019	PSA	075	004	Mithmaikhet e naw koevah, minhmai khen hanh awh. Tamikathoutnaw koe na ki hno hanh.
019	PSA	075	005	Na ki teh a lathueng lah saw sak hanh awh. Lahuen pata lahoi lawk dei hanh awh telah ka ti.
019	PSA	075	006	Bangkongtetpawiteh, tawmnae teh kanîtho, kanîloum, akalah hoi tho hoeh.
019	PSA	075	007	Hateiteh, Cathut teh lawkcengkung doeh. Buet touh a rahnoum sak teh alouke a rasang sak.
019	PSA	075	008	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut kut dawk manang ao teh, misurtui teh a paling. Koung kalawt hnukkhu a rabawk. A laheipadin totouh talai van e tamikayonnaw ni koung a nei awh han.
019	PSA	075	009	Hateiteh, Jakop Cathut teh, ka pholen han, a yungyoe ka pholen han.
019	PSA	075	010	Tamikayon e ki pueng teh, koung ka tâtueng han. Hateiteh, tamikalan e ki teh, tawm lah ao han.
019	PSA	076	001	Kathutkung: Asaph Judah vah Cathut panue lah ao teh, Isarel vah a min teh a lentoe.
019	PSA	076	002	Salem haiyah lukkareiim ao teh, Zion vah a onae hmuen ao.
019	PSA	076	003	Hawvah, licung pala, tarantuknae, bahling hoi tahloinaw hah a khoe awh. (Selah)
019	PSA	076	004	Nang teh, tarantuknae monnaw hlak na sungren teh na hawihnawn.
019	PSA	076	005	A tarankahawinaw lawp lah ao teh, mat a i awh toe. Tami a tha kaawm apinihai a kut dâw thai awh hoeh.
019	PSA	076	006	Oe Jakop Cathut, na yuenae dawk hoi marang hoi ranglengnaw teh kadout e patetlah koung a rawp awh.
019	PSA	076	007	Nang teh taki na tho doeh. Na lungkhuek pawiteh, na hmalah apimouh kangdout thai han.
019	PSA	076	008	Talai vah repcoungroe e naw rungngang teh lawkceng hanelah Cathut a kangdue toteh,
019	PSA	076	009	Na lawkcengnae lawk hah kalvan hoi na patoun teh, talai teh taki laihoi duem ao. (Selah)
019	PSA	076	010	Taminaw e lungkhueknae ni na pholen roeroe han. Ka cawi e lungkhueknae hai na keng dawk na kâyeng han.
019	PSA	076	011	BAWIPA na Cathut koevah, lawkkam awh nateh, kuep sak awh. Atengpam kaawm e pueng ni, taki hanelah kaawm e koevah, poehno hah poe awh.
019	PSA	076	012	Ama ni lawkcengkungnaw e lung hah, a rahnoum sak han. Talai siangpahrangnaw hanelah takikatho poung e lah ao.
019	PSA	077	001	Kathutkung: Asaph Ka lawk hoi Cathut koe ka hram. Ka lawk roeroe hoi Cathut koe ka hram teh, ama ni na thai pouh.
019	PSA	077	002	Runae kâhmo navah Bawipa teh ka kaw. Karum vah ka kut hah pou ka dâw teh, ka hringnae ni duem awm ngai hoeh.
019	PSA	077	003	Cathut ka pouk teh ka cingou. Luepluep ka pouk teh, ka muitha ngawt a tâwn. (Selah)
019	PSA	077	004	Ka mit pou na padai sak teh, pou ka kâroe dawkvah, lawk ka dei thai hoeh.
019	PSA	077	005	Yampa e hninnaw hoi ayan e kumnaw hah ouk ka pouk.
019	PSA	077	006	Karum vah lanaw hah pahnim hoeh nahanlah ka pouk teh, ka lungthung hoi ouk ka pouk. Ka muitha ni hai atangcalah a tawng.
019	PSA	077	007	Bawipa ni pou na pahnim han na maw. Lunghawi laipalah maw ao han aw.
019	PSA	077	008	A lungmanae teh ka pout han na maw. A lawkkam hai kuep laipalah maw pou ao han toung.
019	PSA	077	009	Cathut ni pahrennae a pahnim han na maw. Lungkhuek laihoi a ngai e lungmanae hah a khan toe khe.
019	PSA	077	010	Hete ni ka lung a pataw sak. Hatei, Lathueng Poung aranglae kut a kamnue lahunnae kum hah ka pahnim mahoeh ka ti.
019	PSA	077	011	BAWIPA ni ayan e kângairu hno a sak e naw hah ka pahnim mahoeh.
019	PSA	077	012	Na sak e naw puenghai ka pouk teh, na tawk e hah ka dei han.
019	PSA	077	013	Oe Cathut, na lam teh hmuen kathoung koe ao. Ka Cathut patetlah ka lentoe e Cathut teh apimaw.
019	PSA	077	014	Nang teh, kângairu hno ka sak e Cathut doeh. Tamimaya koe na thaonae hah na kamnue sak.
019	PSA	077	015	Na taminaw hoi Jakop hoi Joseph catounnaw hah na kut hoi na ratang. (Selah)
019	PSA	077	016	Oe Cathut, tuinaw ni na hmu. Tuinaw ni na hmu awh teh, na taki awh. Kadung poung e tui hai a kâhuet.
019	PSA	077	017	Tâmainaw ni tui a rabawk awh teh, kalvannaw a cairing teh, na palanaw teh avoivang lah a yawng awh.
019	PSA	077	018	Na khoparit lawk teh, bongparui dawk ao teh, sumpapalik ni talai pheng a ang sak. Talai teh a kâhuet teh a pâyaw.
019	PSA	077	019	Na lam teh talîpui dawk ao teh, na lamthung teh kakaw e tui dawk ao teh, na khokhnuk teh panue e lah awm hoeh.
019	PSA	077	020	Mosi hoi Aron kut hoi na taminaw hah tuhu patetlah na hrawi.
019	PSA	078	001	Kathutkung: Asaph Oe, ka taminaw ka kâlawk hah tarawi awh nateh, ka dei e lawk hah na hnâpakeng awh.
019	PSA	078	002	Bangnuenae lahoi ka pahni ka ang vaiteh, ayan e lawkkaru hah ka pâpho han.
019	PSA	078	003	Hothateh, ka thai teh, ka panue tangcoung e mintoenaw ni a dei awh e doeh.
019	PSA	078	004	A canaw koehoi kâhrawk mahoeh. Ka tho hane senaw koevah, BAWIPA pholennae, a thaonae, hoi hno kângairu a sak e hah ka dei han.
019	PSA	078	005	Bangtelah tetpawiteh, mintoenaw hah kâ a poe teh, a ca catounnaw koe a panue sak awh nahanlah, Jakop koe lawkpanuesaknae hah acak sak teh, Isarel koe kâlawk hah a poe.
019	PSA	078	006	Kaawm han rae se hoi ka tâcawt han rae camonaw ni, a catounnaw koe a dei awh vaiteh, a panue awh nahanlah,
019	PSA	078	007	Cathut dawk a ngaihawi awh nahan hoi Cathut hnosak hah pahnim laipalah kâpoelawknaw a pahnim awh hoeh nahanlah,
019	PSA	078	008	Mintoenaw patetlah lungpatanae, taranthawnae, kalan e hno dawk a lung kaawm hoeh e, Cathut hanelah yuemkamcu hoeh e muitha lah ao awh hoeh nahane doeh.
019	PSA	078	009	Ephraim catoun teh tarantuknae a khohna teh licung a patuep ei, tarantuk hnin navah a yawng.
019	PSA	078	010	Cathut lawkkam tarawi awh hoeh. Kâlawk tarawi e ngai awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	011	A sak e hoi hno kângairu a sak e hah, a pahnim awh.
019	PSA	078	012	A na mintoenaw e mithmu vah, kângairu hno hah Izip ram Zoan tanghling dawk a sak.
019	PSA	078	013	Talîpui hah a kapek teh ahnimanaw hah a cei sak. Tui hah hnopai patetlah a pâhlawp.
019	PSA	078	014	Kanîthun hai tâmai hoi a hrawi teh, tangmin karoitawi hmaiang hoi a hrawi.
019	PSA	078	015	Kahrawngum vah, lungsong a bawng teh, talîpui tui patetlah moikapap e tui a pânei.
019	PSA	078	016	Lungsong thung hoi tui a tâco sak teh, palangpui patetlah a lawng sak.
019	PSA	078	017	Hatei, ama taranlahoi hoehoe a yon awh teh, kahrawngum vah Lathueng Poung taranlahoi taran a thaw awh.
019	PSA	078	018	Ca han a ngai poung awh e hah a hei awh teh, a lungthin hoi Cathut hah a tanouk awh.
019	PSA	078	019	Bokheiyah, Cathut taranlahoi a dei awh e teh, kahrawngum vah Cathut ni rawca na poe thai awh han na maw, telah ati awh.
019	PSA	078	020	Khenhaw! tui a tâco teh, tuiko muen ka kawi lah a lawng nahan lah lungsongpui hah a hem. Rawca hai a poe thai namaw. A taminaw hah moi a poe thai han na ou, telah ati awh.
019	PSA	078	021	Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni hote lawk hah a thai teh a lungkhuek. Hat toteh, Jakop taranlahoi hmaito a tâco teh, Isarel taranlahoi a lungkhuek.
019	PSA	078	022	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut hah yuem awh hoeh. A rungngangnae hai kâuep awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	023	Hottelah nahlangva, lathueng lae tâmai hah kâ a poe teh, kalvan longkha hah a paawng pouh.
019	PSA	078	024	Ca hane mana hah ahnimouh lathueng a rak sak teh, kalvanlae rawca hah a poe.
019	PSA	078	025	Taminaw ni thaonae rawca hah a ca awh teh, kaboumlah ca hane a patawn.
019	PSA	078	026	Kanîtholae kahlî hah kalvan a tho sak teh, a hnotithainae lahoi a cum lae kahlî hah a tho sak.
019	PSA	078	027	Vaiphu patetlah moi hah a rak sak teh, rathei ka tawn e tavanaw hah tuirai e sadi yit touh apap awh.
019	PSA	078	028	A roenae tengpam petkâkalup lah a bo pouh.
019	PSA	078	029	Hateh, a ca awh teh king a boum awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a ngai awh e patetlah a poe.
019	PSA	078	030	Hatei, a ngai awh e rawca a hmawt awh hoehnahlan, a ca awh lahun navah,
019	PSA	078	031	Cathut lungkhueknae teh ahnimouh koe a pha. A tami tha kaawmnaw hah a thei teh, Isarel thoundounnaw hah koung a rawp sak.
019	PSA	078	032	Hottelah nahlangva, hoehoe a yon awh teh, hno kalen a sak awh e hai bout yuem awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	033	Hatdawkvah, hringyung hnin hah ayawmyin lah a coung sak awh teh, lungpuennae hoi a kum teh a baw sak awh.
019	PSA	078	034	Ahnimanaw hah a thei awh teh, a ma tawng hanelah a ban awh teh, atangcalah Cathut heh a tawng awh.
019	PSA	078	035	Cathut teh amamae lungsongpui doeh tie a panue awh teh, Lathueng Poung Cathut teh na karatangkung doeh tie a panue awh.
019	PSA	078	036	Hateiteh, ama teh a pahni hoi a pholen teh, lai hoi laithoe a dei awh.
019	PSA	078	037	Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimae lungthin teh a hmalah lan hoeh, a lawkkam dawk yuemkamcu awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	038	Hatei, ama teh lungmanae hoi akawi teh, a payonnae heh a ngaithoum teh, koung raphoe hoeh. Bokheiyah, avai moikapap lungkhueknae a roum sak teh, a lungphuennae kaman sak ngai hoeh.
019	PSA	078	039	Bangkongtetpawiteh, takthai lah ao awh teh, bout ban hoeh hanelah, kâha a poe e tie hah pahnim awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	040	Thingyeiyawn vah vai nâyittouh maw a lungkhuek sak awh teh, ramke vah avai nâyittouh maw a lungmathoe sak awh toe.
019	PSA	078	041	Bokheiyah, atuhoitu Cathut a tanouk awh teh, Isarelnaw e Tami Kathoung hah a taran awh.
019	PSA	078	042	A thaonae pâkuem ngai awh hoeh, a tarannaw koehoi a rungngang ei nakunghai, pâkuem ngai awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	043	Izip ram hoi Zoan yawn dawk kângairu hno a sak e hoi.
019	PSA	078	044	Ahnimae palang hah thipaling lah a coung sak teh, ahnimae tuikhunaw hai nei thai hoeh hanlah thipaling lah koung a coung sak.
019	PSA	078	045	Ahnimouh ka kei e bitseinaw hoi, ahnimouh karaphoekung ekkanaw hah a tha pouh.
019	PSA	078	046	Ahnimae a pawhiknaw hah, ahri ni ca hanelah a poe teh, a tawksak awh e a pawhik hah samtongnaw a poe pouh.
019	PSA	078	047	Ahnimae misurnaw teh roun ni koung a raphoe pouh teh, thailahei kungnaw hai tadamtui ni koung a thei pouh.
019	PSA	078	048	Ahnimae saringnaw hai roun ni dêi hanelah a poe pouh teh, saringnaw hah kei ni a ka pouh.
019	PSA	078	049	Takitho e a lungkhueknae hah ahnimouh lathueng a rabawk teh, lungkhueknae, lungpoutnae, hoi runae hah ahnimouh koe thoenae kaphawtkung kalvan tami totouh a tha pouh.
019	PSA	078	050	A lungkhueknae hanlah lamthung a sak, a hringnae hah duenae hlak pasai laipalah, lacik mathout hah letlang a poe.
019	PSA	078	051	Izip vah camin pueng hoi Ham e rim a thaonae hmaloe poung e hoi koung a raphoe.
019	PSA	078	052	Hatei, a taminaw teh tu patetlah a hrawi teh, saringnaw patetlah kahrawngum vah a hrawi.
019	PSA	078	053	Karoumcalah a hrawi teh, taki hane banghai awm hoeh. A tarannaw teh talîpui ni koung a ramuk.
019	PSA	078	054	Hahoi, ramri kathoung, aranglae kut hoi a tawn e, mon totouh a hrawi.
019	PSA	078	055	Ahnimae hmalah, alouke miphunnaw hah a pâlei pouh. A pang awh hane râw hah a bangnue pouh teh, alouklouk lah hmuen a poe.
019	PSA	078	056	Hat nahlangva, Lathueng Poung Cathut hah a tanouk awh teh, a lungkhuek sak awh teh, a panuesaknae lawk hah tarawi awh hoeh.
019	PSA	078	057	A na mintoenaw patetlah a kamlang awh teh, yuemkamcu hoeh lah a kâroe awh. Dumyennae licung patetlah a kâkamei awh.
019	PSA	078	058	Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimae hmuerasangnaw ni a lungkhuek sak teh, a sak awh e meikaphawknaw ni dipma sinnae a tâco sak.
019	PSA	078	059	Hetheh Cathut ni a thai toteh, puenghoi a lungkhuek teh, Isarel hah puenghoi a panuet.
019	PSA	078	060	Hatdawkvah, taminaw koe a ta e Shiloh rim koe totouh a ceitakhai.
019	PSA	078	061	A thaonae teh san lah a coung sak teh, a lentoenae teh a tarannaw kut dawk a poe.
019	PSA	078	062	A taminaw tahloi a kâhmo sak teh, râw lah a coe e naw koe a lungkhuek.
