019	PSA	148	005	Hotnaw pueng teh BAWIPA e kâ lahoi sak e lah ao awh dawkvah, a min teh pholen awh.
019	PSA	148	006	Ama ni hotnaw pueng teh pou acak sak teh kahmat thai hoeh e phung hah a poe.
019	PSA	148	007	Adungpoungnae koe kaawm e naw hoi khoruinaw
019	PSA	148	008	hmai hoi roun, tadamtui hoi a kahû, a lawk patetlah kâroe e kahlî,
019	PSA	148	009	monnaw hoi monrui pueng, thingthai rompo hoi sidarkung pueng,
019	PSA	148	010	moithang ka matheng hoi saring ka mawng pueng, vonpui hoi kâva e hoi kamleng e tava pueng,
019	PSA	148	011	talai van e siangpahrangnaw hoi tami pueng, kacuenaw hoi ukkung khobawi pueng,
019	PSA	148	012	thoundounnaw hoi tanglanaw pueng, matawngnaw hoi camonaw pueng, BAWIPA teh talai van hoi pholen awh.
019	PSA	148	013	A min dueng doeh ka taluepoung, a bawilennae teh talai hoi kalvan lathueng ao dawkvah, BAWIPA min teh pholen awh.
019	PSA	148	014	A taminaw e ki teh a tawm pouh dawkvah, ateng kaawm e taminaw, a tami Isarelnaw e pholen lah kaawm e tamikathoungnaw ni pholen e lah na o. Hallelujah.
019	PSA	149	001	Kathutkung: Panuekhoeh BAWIPA teh pholen awh. BAWIPA koe la katha hah sak awh haw. Tami kathoungnaw kamkhuengnae koe a pahrennae hah pholen awh.
019	PSA	149	002	Isarelnaw ni amamouh kasakkung koe lunghawi naseh. Zion canunaw ni amamae siangpahrang koe konawm naseh.
019	PSA	149	003	Ahnimouh ni lamtu laihoi Bawipa min teh pholen awh naseh. Tâbaw khawng laihoi, ratoung kueng laihoi, pholen hoi la sak awh naseh.
019	PSA	149	004	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni amae taminaw dawk a lungyouk. A ma ni kârahnoum e naw hah rungngangnae hoi a kamcu sak.
019	PSA	149	005	Tami kathoungnaw ni a bawilennae dawkvah, lunghawi awh naseh. Amamae ikhun dawk lunghawi laihoi la sak awh naseh.
019	PSA	149	006	Ahnimae pahni dawk karasangpoung lah Cathut pholennae awm naseh. Ahnimae kut dawk hai, avoivang kahran e tahloi patuem awh naseh.
019	PSA	149	007	Ahnimouh ni khoramnaw moipathung hane hoi taminaw reknae thoseh,
019	PSA	149	008	ahnimae siangpahrangnaw hai sumrui hoi pâkhi vaiteh, ahnimouh thung dawk e bari kaawm e taminaw hah khok dawk hlong buet hoi pâkhi hane thoseh,
019	PSA	149	009	thut e lawkcengnae hah, ahnimouh koe pha sak nahane doeh. Hethateh, tami kathoungnaw pueng koe kaawm hane barinae doeh. Hallelujah.
019	PSA	150	001	Kathutkung: Panuekhoeh BAWIPA teh pholen awh. Thoungnae hmuen koe Cathut teh pholen awh. A Bawilen kamnuenae koe kalvan vah pholen awh.
019	PSA	150	002	Athaonae hnosakenaw dawkvah pholen awh. A lentoenae dawkvah pholen awh.
019	PSA	150	003	Mongka ueng laihoi ama teh pholen awh. Ratoung tamawi kueng laihoi ama teh pholen awh.
019	PSA	150	004	Tâbaw khawng laihoi, lam laihoi, ama teh pholen awh. Rui thueng e naw kueng laihoi, vovit tum laihoi ama teh pholen awh.
019	PSA	150	005	Cecak khawng laihoi ama teh pholen awh. Kacaipounge cecak khawng laihoi ama teh pholen awh.
019	PSA	150	006	Kahring e moithang pueng ni BAWIPA teh pholen awh naseh. Hallelujah.
#
# BOOK	020	PRO	Proverbs	Cingthuilawk
020	PRO	001	001	Isarel siangpahrang, Devit capa Solomon e cingthuilawknaw:
020	PRO	001	002	Lungangnae hoi cangkhainae panue hane hoi thaipanuenae lawk hah thaipanuek hane hoi,
020	PRO	001	003	lungangnae, lannae, lawkcengnae hoi lannae koelah cangkhainae pang hane hoi,
020	PRO	001	004	kamawngrame kâhruetcuet poe hane hoi, thoundounnaw ni panuenae hoi poukthainae a tawn awh nahanlah,
020	PRO	001	005	tami lungkaang ni a thai navah lungang a kâthap vaiteh, thaipanueknae ka tawn e ni lamthung patue thainae a hmu han.
020	PRO	001	006	Cingthuilawk hoi bangnuenae, lungangnae hoi kâpâvêinae naw thaipanuek nahanlah,
020	PRO	001	007	BAWIPA takinae teh panuenae kamtawngnae doeh. Hatei, tamipathunaw ni teh lungangnae hoi cingthuinae hah a dudam awh.
020	PRO	001	008	Ka capa, na pa e pâtunae hah thai nateh, na manu e kâlawk hai pahnawt hanh.
020	PRO	001	009	Hothateh na lû dawk kamthoupnae sammuem lah awm vaiteh, na lahuen dawk awi e dingyin lah ao han.
020	PRO	001	010	Ka capa, tamikayonnaw ni na pasawt pawiteh, ngai pouh hanh.
020	PRO	001	011	Kai koe tho van haw, tami thei hanelah pawm sei. A khuekhaw awm laipalah yonnae ka tawn hoeh naw hah arulahoi pawm awh sei.
020	PRO	001	012	Sheol patetlah a hring lahoi payawp awh vaiteh, kadungpoung e tangkom dawk ka bawt e patetlah,
020	PRO	001	013	Aphu kaawm e hno pueng la awh vaiteh, lawphno hoi mamae im dawk kawi sak awh sei.
020	PRO	001	014	Kaimouh koe kambawng van leih, maimae tangkabom suekâvan sak awh sei ati awh nakunghai,
020	PRO	001	015	ka capa, ahnimouh koe kambawng hanh. Ahnimae lamthung hah roun hanelah kâyawmh.
020	PRO	001	016	Ahnimae khok teh yonnae koe lah a yawng teh, tami thei hanelah a hue a rang awh.
020	PRO	001	017	Bangpatet e tava nakunghai a hmunae koe tamlawk yangda pawiteh, ayawm doeh.
020	PRO	001	018	Hatei, ahnimouh teh amamouh hoi amamouh kâthei hanlah a kâpawp awh teh, amamae hringnae arulahoi ka pawm e lah doeh ao awh.
020	PRO	001	019	Hot patetlah, kamsoumhoehe pungdawnae koe lah kahounlounnaw e hringnae teh, katawnkung hringnae hah a thei awh.
020	PRO	001	020	Lungangnae ni a lawi lahoi kacaipounglah a kaw teh, lam tangkuem dawk lawk ceiceikapanglah a oung.
020	PRO	001	021	Tami kamkhuengnae koe a oung teh, khopui kâennae longkha koe lawk a dei.
020	PRO	001	022	Nangmouh kamawngramenaw, nâtotouh maw cungkeihoehe kamawngrame hah na lungpataw awh han rah. Kadudamnaw ni, dudamnae dawk a nawm awh teh, tamipathunaw ni panuethainae hah a hmuhma awh.
020	PRO	001	023	Kaie yuenae koe kamlang awh, nangmae thung ka muitha ka awi vaiteh, ka lawk hah na panue sak han.
020	PRO	001	024	Na kaw awh ei, na ngai awh hoeh. Ka kut ka dâw ei, apinihai banglah na pouk awh hoeh.
020	PRO	001	025	Kâhruetcuet na poe awh e puenghai na hnoun awh teh, na yuenae puenghai buet touh boehai bout na tarawi awh hoeh.
020	PRO	001	026	Hatdawkvah, yawthoenae na kâhmo awh toteh, na panuikhai vaiteh, lungpuennae na kâhmo awh to hai na panuikhai awh han.
020	PRO	001	027	Takinae kahlî kathout ni na kanawi awh teh, bongparui ni na parit awh toteh, kângairu temdengnae a tho toteh, na panuikhai han.
020	PRO	001	028	Hatnavah, na kaw awh han, hatei, na pato awh mahoeh. Atangcalah na tawng awh han, hatei, na hmawt awh mahoeh.
020	PRO	001	029	Panuethainae hah a hmuhma awh teh, BAWIPA taki hane hah na kârawi awh hoeh.
020	PRO	001	030	Pouknae ka poe e hah ngai awh hoeh, ka yuenae puenghai banglah noutna awh hoeh.
020	PRO	001	031	Hatdawkvah, a hringnuen pawhik hah amamouh ni a ca awh han. A khopouk awh e ni letlang a paha sak han.
020	PRO	001	032	Bangkongtetpawiteh, kamawngrame ni a phen saknae ni a thei awh vaiteh, lawlulawlei ka panuek laipalah, a onae ni a raphoe awh han.
020	PRO	001	033	Hatei, ka lawk ka tarawi e teh, karoumcalah kho a sak han. Thoenae taket laipalah karoumcalah ao awh han.
020	PRO	002	001	Ka capa, ka lawk hah ngâi nateh, kaie kâpoelawknaw e hah na lungthung vah na pâkuem pawiteh,
020	PRO	002	002	Lungangnae koe lah na hnâpakeng nateh, na thai panuek nahanelah na lungthin na poe pawiteh,
020	PRO	002	003	Kapek thai nahanelah na kaw teh, thaipanueknae tawn hanelah na hram pawiteh,
020	PRO	002	004	ngun patetlah na tawng teh, hro e hno patetlah na tawng pawiteh,
020	PRO	002	005	BAWIPA takinae na panue vaiteh, Cathut panuenae hah na hmu han.
020	PRO	002	006	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni lungangnae a poe teh, a pahni hoi panuenae hoi thaipanueknae hah ouk a tâco sak.
020	PRO	002	007	Tamikalannaw hanelah lungangnae katang hah a pâkhueng pouh teh, kalan lah kacetnaw hanelah bahling lah ao.
020	PRO	002	008	Kângingnae lam hah a ring teh, a tamikathoungnaw e lamthung hah a ngue pouh.
020	PRO	002	009	Hottelahoi, kângingnae hoi lannae na thaipanuek vaiteh, ngaima tawnhoehnae hoi kahawi e lamthung hai na panue han.
020	PRO	002	010	Na lungthin dawk lungangnae a kâen toteh, panuenae teh, na hringnae kanawm sakkung lah ao han.
020	PRO	002	011	Poukpanueknae ni na ngue vaiteh, thaipanueknae ni na ring han.
020	PRO	002	012	Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung dawk hoi na rungngang han. Lawk longkawi lah ka dei e,
020	PRO	002	013	Lannae lamthung ka pahnawt niteh, hmonae lamthung dawn hanelah ka cet e,
020	PRO	002	014	thoenae saknae dawk lungkahawi e, tamikathout lanhoehnae dawk a lungkahawi e,
020	PRO	002	015	Lam longkawi ka dawn niteh, a lamthung dawk yuemkamcu hoeh e,
020	PRO	002	016	Kahlong lae napui hoi pasawtpanep lawk ka hno e,
020	PRO	002	017	A naw nah hui ka cettakhai niteh, a Cathut lawkkam kapahnimnaw koehoi nang hah na rungngang han.
020	PRO	002	018	Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnie im ni duenae koe lah a hrawi teh, ahnie lam ni tamikadoutnaw koelah a pâtam.
020	PRO	002	019	Ahni koe kacetnaw teh ban boihoeh toe. Hringnae lam hah dawn boi awh hoeh toe.
020	PRO	002	020	Nang teh tamikahawinaw e lamthung na dawn vaiteh, lannae lamthung pou na dawn thai nahane doeh.
020	PRO	002	021	Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamikalan teh ram dawk kho a sak vaiteh, tami kakuep teh hawvah pou ao han.
020	PRO	002	022	Hatei, tamikathout teh talai van hoi takhoe lah awm vaiteh, yuemkamcu hoeh naw hah phawk lah ao awh han.
020	PRO	003	001	Ka capa, kaie kâlawk hah pahnim hanh. Kaie kâpoelawknaw hah na lung dawk pâkuemh.
020	PRO	003	002	Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote ni na hringsawnae hoi roumnae na thap sin han.
020	PRO	003	003	Lungmanae hoi lawkkatang ni na cettakhai hanh naseh. Na lahuen dawk awi nateh, na lungthin dawkvah thut haw.
020	PRO	003	004	Hottelah Cathut hoi tami hmalah, minhmai kahawi na hmu vaiteh, tawmrasang lah na o han.
020	PRO	003	005	Na lungthin buem hoi BAWIPA kâuep nateh, nama e thaipanueknae hah kângue hanh.
020	PRO	003	006	Na lamthung pueng dawk ama na panuek haw, na lamthung pueng dawk na hrawi han.
020	PRO	003	007	Namahoima lungkaang lah kâsak hanh. BAWIPA hah taket nateh yon cettakhaih.
020	PRO	003	008	Na takthai hanelah damnae lah ao vaiteh, na hru hanelah thasainae lah ao han.
020	PRO	003	009	Na tawnta e naw hoi aluepawnaw hoi BAWIPA hah bari haw.
020	PRO	003	010	Hahoi na capai dawk a kawi vaiteh, misur katinnae tangkom dawk misur katha hoi a kawi han.
020	PRO	003	011	Ka capa, BAWIPA yuenae hah dudam hanh. Na phep e hai hmuhma hanh.
020	PRO	003	012	Bangkongtetpawiteh, na pa ni a lungpataw e capa teh ouk a yue e patetlah, BAWIPA ni a lungpataw e naw hah ouk a yue.
020	PRO	003	013	Lungmanae kahmawtnaw teh a lung kahawi e tami lah ao awh teh, Thaipanueknae ka tawn e tami hai a lung kahawi e tami lah ao.
020	PRO	003	014	Bangkongtetpawiteh, ngun pungdaw sak e hlak, lungmanae pungdaw sak e hah ahawihnawn.
020	PRO	003	015	Talungpaling hlak hai aphu ao teh, na ngai e pueng ni hai phat hoeh rah.
020	PRO	003	016	Aranglae kut dawk hringsawnae ao teh, avoilah e kut dawk hnopai hoi barinae ao.
020	PRO	003	017	A lamthung teh lamthung kanawm lah ao teh, a lamthung pueng teh roumnae lah ao awh.
020	PRO	003	018	Kakuennaw hanelah hringnae thingkung lah ao teh, ka hringkhaie pueng teh tami lung kahawi e lah ao awh.
020	PRO	003	019	BAWIPA ni lungangnae lahoi talai hah a kangdue sak teh, thaipanueknae lahoi kalvan a cak sak.
020	PRO	003	020	A panuenae lahoi talî a kapek teh, tâmai ni tadamtui a bo sak.
020	PRO	003	021	Ka capa, lungangnae katang hoi panuethainae hah kuen nateh, na mit hoi kâhlat sak hanh.
020	PRO	003	022	Hottelah pawiteh, na muitha hanelah hringnae lah awm vaiteh, na lahuen hanelah pahrennae lah ao han.
020	PRO	003	023	Hottelah na lamthung dawk karoumcalah na cet vaiteh, na khok na kamthui mahoeh.
020	PRO	003	024	Na i navah na taket mahoeh, ihmu katuilah na i han.
020	PRO	003	025	Taki ka tho e kaluekalapnae hai taket hanh. Hoehpawiteh, tamikathoutnaw ni a kâhmo awh e runae hai taket hanh.
020	PRO	003	026	Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA teh na kânguenae lah awm vaiteh, na khok teh karap dawk hoi a hlout sak han.
020	PRO	003	027	Sak nahane kâ na kut dawk ao nahlangva, hmu hanelah kakamcunaw hah hnokahawi pasoung laipalah awm hanh.
020	PRO	003	028	Poe hane na sin nahlangva, cet ei, bout tho lah a, tangtho torei na poe han, telah na imri koe tet pouh hanh.
020	PRO	003	029	Na imri taranlahoi thoenae sak hanelah kâcai hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang na ka ring e doeh.
020	PRO	003	030	Nang dawk patawnae na poe hoeh pawiteh, a khuekhaw awm laipalah tami taran hanh.
020	PRO	003	031	Tami rep kacoungroenaw e hnopai noe awh hanh. Ahnimae lamthung hai rawi awh hanh.
020	PRO	003	032	Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lungthin ka longkawi e teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho teh, a lungthin kalan e teh, ama hoi arulahoi kâponae ao.
020	PRO	003	033	Tamikathoutnaw e im dawk, BAWIPA thoebonae ao, hatei, tamikalannaw e im teh, yawhawi a poe.
020	PRO	003	034	Dudam lahoi kaawmnaw hah a dudam teh, ka kârahnoumnaw hah pahrennae a poe.
020	PRO	003	035	Tami lungkaang ni bawilennae râw a coe han. Hatei, tamipathunaw ni a coe awh e râw teh, kayanae doeh.
020	PRO	004	001	Ka canaw, na pa ni na cangkhainae hah thai awh nateh, thaipanueknae hah panue hanelah na hnâpakeng awh.
020	PRO	004	002	Bangkongtetpawiteh, cangkhainae kahawi hah na poe dawkvah, kaie kâlawk hah cettakhai hanh.
020	PRO	004	003	Apa e capa lah ka o navah, anu e capa a pahren e tawntoe e capa lah ka o.
020	PRO	004	004	Pâtu hai na pâtu teh, na lungthin hoi ka lawknaw hah pâkuem haw. Kaie kâpoelawknaw hah tarawi nateh hring haw.
020	PRO	004	005	Lungangnae hah tawn nateh, thaipanueknae hah tawn haw. Ka pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawknaw hah pahnim laipalah, kamlang takhai hanh.
020	PRO	004	006	Cettakhai hanh, na ring nakaima. Lungpataw haw na ngue han kaima.
020	PRO	004	007	Lungangnae teh a lawkpui poung doeh.
020	PRO	004	008	Talue sak haw, na tawmrasang han. Tapam haw, barinae koe na ceikhai han.
020	PRO	004	009	Na lû dawk lungmanae na kâmuk sak han, bawilennae bawilakhung hah na kâmuk sak han.
020	PRO	004	010	Ka capa, ka dei e hah thai nateh, dâw haw. Na hringyung a saw sak han.
020	PRO	004	011	Lungangnae lamthung na cangkhai teh, lamkalan dawk na hrawi.
020	PRO	004	012	Na cei navah, na khok hanelah kamthuinae awm mahoeh, na yawng navah na tâlaw mahoeh.
020	PRO	004	013	Na cangkhainae hah kacaklah kuen nateh, tha laipalah pou kuen haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na hringnae doeh.
020	PRO	004	014	Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung dawk kâen awh hanh. Tami kahawihoehnaw e lamthung dawn hanh.
020	PRO	004	015	Roun nateh, khoeroe dawn hanh, kamlang takhai nateh, cettakhaih.
020	PRO	004	016	Bangkongtetpawiteh, hno kathout sak hoeh pawiteh, ip thai awh hoeh niteh, tami buetbuet touh tâlaw sak hoehpawiteh, ihmu tho awh hoeh.
020	PRO	004	017	Bangkongtetpawiteh, thoenae vaiyei hah a ca awh teh, rektapnae yamu hah a nei awh.
020	PRO	004	018	Hatei, tamikalannaw e lamthung teh, kanî raeng, kanî tuengtalueng a thunnae kanî ang patetlah ao.
020	PRO	004	019	Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung teh khohmo patetlah ao teh, tâlawnae akungcing hai panuek awh hoeh.
020	PRO	004	020	Ka capa, ka lawk kahawicalah thai haw, ka dei e hah atangcalah pouk.
020	PRO	004	021	Na mit hoi kâhlat sak hanh, na lungthin dawk pâkuemh.
020	PRO	004	022	Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahmawtnaw hanelah hringnae lah ao teh, a takthai abuemlah hanelah damnae lah ao.
020	PRO	004	023	Hno pueng hlak hoi na lungthin hah kahawicalah ring haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hringnae akungtuen lah ao.
020	PRO	004	024	Dumyennae pahni hah pahnawt nateh, payonnae pahni hah ahlanae koe takhoe haw.
020	PRO	004	025	Na mit hoi hmalah kalan lah khen nateh, na hmalah kalan lah radoung haw.
020	PRO	004	026	Na lamthung hah hmaloe rip nateh, na lamthung pueng hah cak sak.
020	PRO	004	027	Aranglah nakunghai, avoilah nakunghai phen hanh. Thoenae lamthung hah roun haw.
020	PRO	005	001	Ka capa, poukpanueknae na tawn nahane hoi, na pahni ni panuenae a pâkuem thai nahanelah,
020	PRO	005	002	kaie lungangnae hah thai nateh, kaie thaipanueknae dawk na hnâpakeng haw.
020	PRO	005	003	Bangkongtetpawiteh, napui kathoutnaw e pahni teh, khoitui patetlah a radip, a lawk teh sathaw hlak hai a pâhnan.
020	PRO	005	004	Hatei, apoutnae koe lateh, hmue patetlah a kha teh, avoivang kahran e sarai patetlah a hran.
020	PRO	005	005	A khok ni duenae lamthung a pâtam teh, a khok takan ni sheol hmai a pâtam.
020	PRO	005	006	Hoehpawiteh, a hringnae lamthung na pouk hoeh vaiteh, a lamthung a cak hoeh e hah na panuek mahoeh.
020	PRO	005	007	Hatdawkvah, ka canaw, atuvah, ka lawk thai awh haw. Ka dei e lawknaw hah pahnawt awh hanh.
020	PRO	005	008	Hatei, ahlanae koe kampuen awh nateh, ahnie im takhang hoi hai hnai awh hanh.
020	PRO	005	009	Hoehpawiteh, barinae na hmu e hah ayâ alouk koe kampuen payon vaih. Tami nuen kamathoutnaw rahak vah, na hringnae be na hno payon vaih.
020	PRO	005	010	Hoehpawiteh, ramlouknaw ni na tawntanae dawk nawm awh vaiteh, na thaw tawk e a pawnaw hah ramlouknaw im vah phat payon vaih.
020	PRO	005	011	Apoutnae koe lah, na takthai a kamsoe toteh, na khui payon vaih.
020	PRO	005	012	Bangtelamaw, cangkhainae hah koe ka hmuhma teh, yuenae hah ka lungthin hoi koe ka dudam toe.
020	PRO	005	013	Na kacangkhaikung e lawk hah koe ka tarawi ngaihoeh niteh, na cangkhainae hah koe ka thai ngaihoeh heh ma.
020	PRO	005	014	Tamimaya hoi kamkhuengnaw koe rawknae kâhmo hoeh e dueng doeh hei na ti han na kaima.
020	PRO	005	015	Nange tuikhu, na tuikhu hoi ka tâcawt e tui roeroe hah na nei han.
020	PRO	005	016	Na tuiphuek hah ram tangkuem lawng vaiteh tamimaya ceinae lamnaw dawk a lawng han na maw.
020	PRO	005	017	Nama hanelah dueng awm seh, ayâ alouke hoi kâkabawpkhai hane nahoeh.
020	PRO	005	018	Na tuikhu teh yawhawi seh, na naw nah e na yu koe na lungkuep lawih.
020	PRO	005	019	Ngai kaawm e sayuk hoi a meikahawi e sayukhre patetlah, a sannunaw ni na lungkuep sak naseh. A lungpatawnae ni na lungkuep sak naseh.
020	PRO	005	020	Bangtelamaw, ka capa nang ni napui kahawihoehe hah na ngai vaiteh, khuet na tapam han vaw.
