020	PRO	026	028	Laithoe ka dei e ni a rektap e naw hah ouk a hmuhma, oupnae kaphawk ni rawknae a tâcokhai.
020	PRO	027	001	Tangtho e hnin hanlah kâoup hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh bangmaw a tâcokhai han tie na panuek hoeh.
020	PRO	027	002	Namahoima laipalah ayâ ni na pholen naseh, nama e pahni ni laipalah alouke ni na pholen naseh.
020	PRO	027	003	Talung hai a ri teh sadi hai a ri, hatei tamipathu lungkhueknae teh hotnaw hlak a ri hnawn.
020	PRO	027	004	Lungkhueknae teh a mathoe, lungphuennae teh a matheng, hatei utnae teh apinimaw a khang thai han.
020	PRO	027	005	Hro e lungpatawnae hlak teh hmantang yue e ahawihnawn.
020	PRO	027	006	Hmâ na ka paca e hui teh yuem a kamcu, hatei taran ni na paco e teh dumyennae doeh.
020	PRO	027	007	A von ka paha tangcoung e ni teh khoipha patenghai ngai mahoeh toe, hatei a von ka hlam e tami hanelah teh kakhat e patenghai a radip.
020	PRO	027	008	Ma e imlaw ka palum ngai hoeh e teh, tava a tabu dawk kaawm ngai hoeh e hoi a kâvan.
020	PRO	027	009	Satui hoi hmuitui ni lungthin a konawm sak teh, hui kahawi ni pouknae na poe e ni hringnae konawm sak.
020	PRO	027	010	Na pa e hui hoi nama e hui kapek hanh, runae na kâhmo navah na hmaunawngha im kuekluek cet hanh, ahlanae koe e na hmaunawngha hlak teh a hnainae koe e na hui a hawihnawn.
020	PRO	027	011	Na ka pacekpahlek e ka pathung thai nahanlah ka capa, lungang haw, ka lungthin konawm sak haw.
020	PRO	027	012	Tamilungkaang ni thoenae hah sut a hmu teh a kâhro, kamawngrame ni teh a kâphumsin teh rek e lah ouk ao.
020	PRO	027	013	Tamitavan hanelah amahkhankung teh a angki amahkhan nahanelah la pouh lah ao vaiteh napui koe poe naseh.
020	PRO	027	014	Amom a thaw teh kacaipounglah a hui yawhawi ka poe e teh, thoebonae lah pouk pouh lah ao han.
020	PRO	027	015	Lai pou ka roe e yu teh, Puenghoi khonan hnin e khoramei hoi a kâvan.
020	PRO	027	016	Hote napui ka pâkuem e teh, kahlî ka pâkuem niteh, aranglae kut dawk satui kasum e hoi a kâvan.
020	PRO	027	017	Sum teh sum hoi doeh letlang hran sak thai, hot patetlah tami ni a hui e a minhmai ouk a pan sak.
020	PRO	027	018	Thaibunglung kung ka tawn e pueng ni thaibunglung paw a ca han, hot patetlah a bawi e thaw ka tawk e teh bari lah ao han.
020	PRO	027	019	Tui dawk coungnae a kamnue, hot patetlah tami lungthin ni tami a kamnue sak.
020	PRO	027	020	Sheol hoi rawkkahmanae teh khout boihoeh, hot patetlah tami e mit ni a khout tie tawn boihoeh.
020	PRO	027	021	Sôlêinae manang teh ngun hanelah, takhuenhmai teh sui hanelah ao. Tami teh oup e lahoi a bawilennae panue lah ao.
020	PRO	027	022	Tamipathu teh sumdawk cakang hoi mek ka phawm nakunghai a pathunae ni cettakhai pawm mahoeh.
020	PRO	027	023	Na tuhu kong panue nahanlah panki loe, na saringhu hah kahawicalah a kountouk.
020	PRO	027	024	Bangkongtetpawiteh, tawntanae heh a yungyoe kangning hoeh, hoehpawiteh bawilukhung heh se pueng dawk kangning hoeh.
020	PRO	027	025	Phonaw hai a pâw, catinaw hai a pâw, law e a pawnaw hai khue lah ao.
020	PRO	027	026	Tunaw ni na khohna hane hmaenaw ni lawhmuen ran nahane ouk a thokhai.
020	PRO	027	027	Nang ni na ca hane, imthungnaw ca hane, sannunaw ca hanelah hmae sanutui teh a khout han doeh.
020	PRO	028	001	Tamikathout teh apinihai pâlei hoeh eiteh a yawng, hatei tamikalan teh sendek patetlah a taran ahawi.
020	PRO	028	002	Khocanaw lawkeknae kecu dawk khobawinaw tuhoitu a kâthung awh, hatei thaipanueknae hoi panuenae katawnnaw kecu dawk ram a kangning han.
020	PRO	028	003	Tamimathoe ni tamimathoe repcoungroe e teh ca hane pek laipalah ka cetkhai e longhotui hoi a kâvan.
020	PRO	028	004	Kâlawk ka cettakhai e ni tamikathout a pholen, hatei kâlawk ka tarawi ni ouk a tuk awh.
020	PRO	028	005	Tamikathoutnaw ni lannae thaipanuek awh hoeh, hatei BAWIPA katawngnaw ni bangpueng hai a thaipanuek.
020	PRO	028	006	Tawnta laihoi a khuekhaw awm laipalah hring hlak teh tamimathoe yuemkamculah kaawm e ahawihnawn.
020	PRO	028	007	Kâlawk ka tarawi e teh a lungkaang e capa doeh, ka kâso e hoi kamyawng e ni a na pa yeirai a po sak.
020	PRO	028	008	Apung ka cat ni teh kalan hoeh e lahoi hnopai ka tawnta e ni tamimathoe kabawmkung hanelah a pâtung pouh.
020	PRO	028	009	Kâlawk ka tarawi ngai hoeh e teh a ratoumnae hai panuet a tho.
020	PRO	028	010	Thoenae lam dawk tamikalan lam ka phen sak e teh ama ni a tai e tangkom dawk a bo han, hatei toun kaawm hoeh e ni hnokahawi a coe han.
020	PRO	028	011	Ka tawnta e ni amahoima a lungkaang lah a kâpouk, hatei thaipanueknae ka tawn e tamimathoe ni peng a pâpho han.
020	PRO	028	012	Tamikalan a lunghawi navah kalen e bawilennae ao, hatei tamikathout a kangdue toteh taminaw a kâhro awh.
020	PRO	028	013	Amae yonae ka hrawk e teh hawinae hmawt mahoeh, hatei ka pâpho e ni pahrennae a hmu han.
020	PRO	028	014	Takinae pou ka tawn e teh a yawkahawi e doeh, hatei a lung pou ka patak e teh rawkkahmanae hoi a kâhmo han.
020	PRO	028	015	Mathoenaw kaukkung bawi kathout teh sendek ka huk e hoi tavom ka hram e patetlah ao.
020	PRO	028	016	Thaipanueknae ka vout e ukkung niteh rep a coungroe hatei hounlounnae ka hmuhma e ukkung teh a hringsaw han.
020	PRO	028	017	Tamikathet e teh phuen tangkom koe yawng na lawiseh, apinihai ngang nahan seh.
020	PRO	028	018	Lam kalan dawk ka dawn e tami teh a hlout han, hatei lam longkawi dawk ka dawn e teh vaitalahoi a rawp han.
020	PRO	028	019	Laikawk ka thawn e teh rawca moi a tawn han, hatei ayawmyinlah kaawm e tami teh a mathoe han.
020	PRO	028	020	Yuemkamcu e ni yawhawinae kapap a hmu han, hatei dongdengca dawk tawnta hanelah kâcai e teh rek laipalah awm mahoeh.
020	PRO	028	021	Minhmai khet tawnnae teh hawi hoeh, vaiyei tangen kecu dawk tami kâlawk ouk a tapoe awh.
020	PRO	028	022	Dongdengca dawk tawnta hanelah kâcai e tami teh thoenae mit a tawn, bout mathoe han doeh tie pouk hoeh.
020	PRO	028	023	Tami ka oup e hlak teh tami ka yue e ni a hnukkhu pholennae a coe han.
020	PRO	028	024	A manu hoi a na pa hno ka lawm niteh, kâtapoenae nahoeh ka tet e tami teh, karaphoekung e hui doeh.
020	PRO	028	025	Tami kâoup e lungthin ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai, hatei BAWIPA kâuep e teh a lamcawn han.
020	PRO	028	026	Amae pouknae ka kâuep e teh tamipathu doeh, hatei lungang lahoi kaawm e teh hlout lah ao han.
020	PRO	028	027	Tamimathoenaw hno ka poe e teh vout mahoeh, hatei ka roun e tami teh puenghoi thoebonae a hmu han.
020	PRO	028	028	Tamikathoutnaw a kangdue toteh taminaw amahmawk a kâhro awh, hatei a rawk awh toteh tamikalannaw a pung awh.
020	PRO	029	001	Voutsout yue eiteh a lahuen ka patak sak e tami teh, hawinae awm laipalah hmawi a rawk han.
020	PRO	029	002	Tamikalan ni kâtawnnae a tawn toteh tamimaya a konawm awh, hatei tamikathout ni a uk navah tamimaya a cingou awh.
020	PRO	029	003	Lungangnae ka ngai e ni a na pa a konawm sak, hatei kâyawt e hoi kamyawng e tami ni a hnopai koung a pâbaw.
020	PRO	029	004	Siangpahrang ni lawkcengnae lahoi ram a caksak, hatei tadawnghno ni ram a rawk sak.
020	PRO	029	005	A imri laithoe lahoi ka oup e teh a khok kâman nahanlah tamlawk a yangda pouh.
020	PRO	029	006	Kâtapoenae ni tamikathout a man, hatei tamikalan teh la sak lahoi a lunghawi.
020	PRO	029	007	Tamikalan ni tamimathoe hanlah a pouk, hatei tamikathout ni teh banglahai noutna hoeh.
020	PRO	029	008	Kadudamnaw ni khopui hmai a sawi, hatei tamilungkaang ni teh lungkhueknae a takhoe thai.
020	PRO	029	009	Tamilungkaang ni tamipathu hoi kâyue pawiteh, tamipathu a panui hai thoseh, a lungphuen hai thoseh banglahai tho hoeh.
020	PRO	029	010	Tami kathetnaw ni tamikalan a hmuhma awh, tamikalan teh hawinae hah a tawng.
020	PRO	029	011	Tamipathu ni a pouk e pueng hah a dei, hatei tamilungkaang ni teh a panguep.
020	PRO	029	012	Ukkung ni laithoe dei e banghai nahoeh tet pawiteh, a sannaw pueng teh tamikathout lah koung a coung awh.
020	PRO	029	013	Tamimathoe hoi repcoungroenaw ni cungtalah a hmawng e teh, BAWIPA ni a mit reirei a ang sak.
020	PRO	029	014	Atangcalah tamimathoe hanelah lawkcengkung siangpahrang teh, a bawitungkhung a yungyoe caksak lah ao han.
020	PRO	029	015	Bongpai hoi yuenae ni tami a lungangsak teh, ka pangak e camo ni a manu yeirai a po sak.
020	PRO	029	016	Tamikathout apapnae koe kâtapoenae apap, hatei tamikalan ni a rawk awh e hah a hmu.
020	PRO	029	017	Na capa hah yue yaw lannae na poe han, hothloilah hring nawmnae na poe han.
020	PRO	029	018	Vision ohoehnae koe tami pueng a thathoe awh, hatei kâlawk ka tarawi e teh tami yawkahawi e doeh.
020	PRO	029	019	San teh lawk hoi dueng yue thai lah awm hoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh a thai eiteh tarawi laipalah ao thai.
020	PRO	029	020	Pouk laipalah lawk ka deirumram e ouk na hmu ou, hot patet e tami koe hlak teh tamipathu koe ngaihawine bet aohnawn.
020	PRO	029	021	Camo nah ekvoi pahren e san teh a cue torei teh calan e lah ao han.
020	PRO	029	022	A lung ka khuek e ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai teh, ka matheng e ni kâtapoenae pou a tâcokhai.
020	PRO	029	023	Ma e kâoupnae ni na rahnoumsak han, hatei muitha lahoi kârahnoum e ni barinae a coe.
020	PRO	029	024	Tamru hoi kamyawng e teh amae hringnae ka hmuhma e tami doeh, lawkkatang dei hanelah thoe a kâbo ei dei kalawn hoeh.
020	PRO	029	025	Tami barinae ni karap patetlah na man, hatei BAWIPA kâuep e teh rungngang lah ao han.
020	PRO	029	026	Tami kapap ni ukkungnaw e lungyouknae hah a tawng awh, hatei taminaw hanelah lawkcengnae teh BAWIPA koehoi doeh a tho.
020	PRO	029	027	Tamikalanhoehe teh tamikalan hanelah panuet a tho e patetlah, tamikalan teh tamikalanhoehnaw hanelah panuet a tho van.
020	PRO	030	001	Jakeh capa Agur ni a dei e lawk. Ama ni Ithiel, Ithiel hoi Ucal koe hettelah a dei.
020	PRO	030	002	Tamipueng hlak tamipathu poung lah ka o teh, thaipanueknae hai ka tawn hoeh.
020	PRO	030	003	Lungangnae hai kamtu van hoeh niteh, tamikathoungnaw e panuenae hai ka tawn hoeh.
020	PRO	030	004	Kalvan ka luen ni teh ka kum e teh apimaw, Talai poutnae pueng kacaksakkung teh apimaw, A min apimaw, a capa min hai apimaw, na panue maw.
020	PRO	030	005	Cathut lawk pueng teh a thoung, ka kânguenaw pueng hanelah kânguenae lah ao.
020	PRO	030	006	A lawk hah thap hanh, hoehpawiteh na yue vaiteh, na laithoe e hah a hmu han.
020	PRO	030	007	Hno kahni touh ka hei han, ka due hoehnahlan na poe haw.
020	PRO	030	008	Ahrawnghrang hoi laithoenae heh kai hoi ahlanae koe na tat pouh haw, mathoenae nakunghai, tawntanae nakunghai na poe hanh, ka panki e rawca hoi na kawk haw.
020	PRO	030	009	Hoehpawiteh ka tawnta vaiteh na pahnawt payon vaih, BAWIPA teh apimaw, ka tet payon vaih. Hoehpawiteh, ka mathoe vaiteh hno ka parawt vaiteh Cathut min ka mathout sakpayon vaih.
020	PRO	030	010	San teh a bawi koe pathoe hanh, hoehpawiteh thoe na bo vaiteh, nang dawk yonnae ao han.
020	PRO	030	011	A na pa thoe a bo teh a manu yawhawi a poe ngaihoehnae se ao.
020	PRO	030	012	Ama mithmu vah kathoung poung lah kâpouknae ao, hatei a khinnae koehoi pâsu hoeh rah.
020	PRO	030	013	Khopouk ka rasang ni teh moungnae a o, a khopouk teh a rasang katang.
020	PRO	030	014	A hâ teh sendek patetlah, a hâkamnaw teh sarai patetlah a onae se a o, het talai van e tami mathoenaw hoi kavoutthoupnaw hah koung ca hanelah kakâcainaw doeh.
020	PRO	030	015	Tavat ni canu kahni touh a tawn teh, na poe na poe a ti. Ka boum thai hoeh e kathum touh ao. A khout toe ka tet boihoeh e hno pali touh a o
020	PRO	030	016	Tangkom, kating e thun, tui ka boum hoeh e talai, a khout toe ka tet boihoeh e hmai naw hah doeh.
020	PRO	030	017	A na pa ka dudam niteh a manu banglah ka noutna hoeh naw e mit teh, vonga ni a cawngkhawi pouh vaiteh, matawcanaw ni a ca awh han.
020	PRO	030	018	Kai hanlah kângairu hno kathum touh a o, ka thaipanuek hoeh e hno pali touh teh,
020	PRO	030	019	Kahlî dawk mataw kamlengnae lamthung, Lungphen van tahrun ceinae, tuipui van long ceinae, hoi thoundoun ni tangla painae lam naw hah doeh.
020	PRO	030	020	Napui kahawihoeh hai hottelah doeh ao van, a ca hnukkhu a pahni a hui teh yonnae ka sak hoeh, telah ouk a ti.
020	PRO	030	021	Hno kathum touh kecu talai heh taki hoi ouk a pâyaw, bokheiyah, hno pali touh khang thai hoeh e ao.
020	PRO	030	022	Siangpahrang lah kâsak e san, king ka boum e tamipathu,
020	PRO	030	023	Vâ ka sak e napui kathout, a bawipa e yu ka khawng e sannu hetnaw hah doeh.
020	PRO	030	024	Talaivan a thoungca eiteh a lungkaang e hno pali touh ao.
020	PRO	030	025	Atha awm hoeh eiteh kompawi vah ama hane rawca ka pâtung e lungkhi,
020	PRO	030	026	a tha ayoun eiteh lungha rahak kaawm e saveh.
020	PRO	030	027	siangpahrang tawn hoeh eiteh ahuhu lahoi ka cet e samtong,
020	PRO	030	028	a khok hoi a kâbang eiteh siangpahrang im kaawm e bombanaw hah doeh.
020	PRO	030	029	Hno kathum touh kahawicalah ka cet thai e a o, bokheiyah pali touh hah teh,
020	PRO	030	030	Saring pueng dawk athakaawme sendek, bang ni hai ngang thai hoeh.
020	PRO	030	031	Ransa marang, hmaetan, apinihai ngang thai hoeh e siangpahrang hetnaw hah doeh.
020	PRO	030	032	Mahoima kâtalue totouh na pathu pawiteh, hoehpawiteh hnokathout sak hanelah na kâcai pawiteh, na kut hoi na pahni tabuemh.
020	PRO	030	033	Bangkongtetpawiteh, maitosanutui kalaw e ni sanutuikamkak a tâcosak e patetlah, hnawng kapennae ni hnawngthi a lawng sak. Hot patetlah lungkhueknae ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai.
020	PRO	031	001	Siangpahrang Lemuel lawk, a manu ni a cangkhai e naw teh:
020	PRO	031	002	Bangtelane ka capa, bangtelane ka khe e capa, bangtelane ka lawkkam capa.
020	PRO	031	003	Siangpahrangnaw patenghai karaphoekung napui koe na thaonae poe hanh.
020	PRO	031	004	Aw Lemuel, misurtui nei e hoi yamu nei e teh siangpahrangnaw hane nahoeh.
020	PRO	031	005	Hoehpawiteh, net awh vaiteh kâlawk pahnim awh vaiteh mathoenaw hanelah kalanhoehe lah lawkceng awh langvaih.
020	PRO	031	006	Meimei kadout e hah yamu pânei awh nateh, lungrei ka thai e hah misurtui pânei awh.
020	PRO	031	007	Net awh naseh, a reithainae hah pahnim awh naseh, a lungmathoenae pahnim totouh net awh naseh.
020	PRO	031	008	Lawkanaw hanlah dei pouh nateh, due hanelah lawk tâtueng pouh e naw hane hai dei pouh.
020	PRO	031	009	Kalan lah lawkceng nateh tamimathoe hoi tamikavout hanlah kâhet pouh.
020	PRO	031	010	Yu kahawi apinimaw a hmu thai han. Bangkongtetpawiteh talung phukaawm hlak hai aphuohnawn.
020	PRO	031	011	A vâ ni a lungthin hoi a kâuep teh hawinae awm laipalah awm mahoeh.
020	PRO	031	012	A hring nathung thoenae laipalah hawinae dueng doeh a sak pouh.
020	PRO	031	013	Tumuen hoi pahla hah a tawng teh a kut hoi amahmawk ouk a tawk.
020	PRO	031	014	Hno ka yawt e long patetlah ao teh, ahlanae koehoi rawca ouk a thokhai.
020	PRO	031	015	Amom a thaw teh a imthungnaw hah rawca a paca teh, a sannunaw hah thaw rip a boun.
020	PRO	031	016	Lawhmuen hah a khet teh a ran, a tawkphu hoi misur takha a sak.
020	PRO	031	017	A keng dawk tha a kâyeng teh, a kuttha hai a patung.
020	PRO	031	018	Hno a yo e a mek tie a panue dawkvah tangmin patenghai hmaiim dout hoeh.
020	PRO	031	019	A kut hoi rahakut a kuet teh, avanglae kut hoi yâcung a kuet.
020	PRO	031	020	Tamimathoe hanelah a kut a kâyap, bokheiyah kavoutnaw totouh a kut ni koung a pha.
020	PRO	031	021	Tadamtui ka bawt nakunghai a imthungnaw hanelah taki hane awm hoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh a imthungnaw ni dikpalingca e khohna kabet e a khohna awh.
020	PRO	031	022	Ama hanlah hni a kawng teh, loukloukkaang e hoi pu doeh a khohna.
020	PRO	031	023	A vâ hai kho longkha koe khobawinaw hoi a tahung toteh mithmaiben e lah ao.
020	PRO	031	024	Loukloukkaang e hni a kawng teh a yo, hno kayawtnaw koe taisawm hah a yo.
020	PRO	031	025	A kawng e khohna teh a khaw, ahawi dawkvah ahni teh hmalah a konawm han.
020	PRO	031	026	Lungangnae hoi lawk a dei, a lawk teh pahrennae kâlawk lah ao.
020	PRO	031	027	A imthung khosaknae kahawicalah koung a khetyawt, rawca hai pamda laihoi cat boihoeh.
020	PRO	031	028	A canaw a thaw awh teh a manu koe a lunghawi awh. A vâ ni hai a oup van,
020	PRO	031	029	napui kapap ni kahawicalah a tawk awh toe, hatei nang ni ahnimanaw na tapuet toe, atipouh.
020	PRO	031	030	Raimonae teh dumnae doeh, meihawinae hai a yawmyin doeh. Hatei BAWIPA ka taket e napui teh oup lah ao han.
020	PRO	031	031	A kut hoi a tawk e a paw hah poe awh nateh, longkha koe ama roeroe hah a tawk e ni oup naseh.
#
# BOOK	021	ECC	Ecclesiastes	Phungdeikung
021	ECC	001	001	Devit capa, phungdeikung Jerusalem siangpahrang ni a dei e lawk teh,
021	ECC	001	002	Ahrawnghrang doeh, ahrawnghrang doeh. Bangpueng hai ahrawnghrang doeh.
021	ECC	001	003	Kanî rahim vah tami ni a tawksak e pueng bang hawinae maw kaawm.
021	ECC	001	004	Se buet touh aloum teh se alouke bout a tâco. Hatei, talai teh a kangning.
021	ECC	001	005	Kanî a tâco teh bout a khup. Hatei, a tâconae koehoi bout bout a tâco.
021	ECC	001	006	Kahlî haiyah a kâheinae koe lah bout bout a kâhei.
021	ECC	001	007	Tuipuinaw a lawng teh talîpui dawk koung a kâcu eiteh kawi hoeh. Talîpui teh a lawngnae koelah bout bout a ban.
021	ECC	001	008	Bangpueng hai tami ni dei thai hoeh totouh patangnae a kâhmo. Mit ni a khet eiteh hmawt thai hoeh. Hnâ ni a thai eiteh boum thai hoeh.
021	ECC	001	009	Hno kaawm tangcoung e hai bout kaawm hane hoi a kâvan. Atu sak e hai bout sak hane hoi a kâvan. Kanî rahim vah hno katha awm hoeh.
021	ECC	001	010	Khenhaw! hno katha buet tabang ao maw awm hoeh, ayan vah yo kaawm tangcoung e doeh.
021	ECC	001	011	Ayan kaawm boi e hnonaw ouk pahnim thai awh. Ka tho hane naw hai ka tho hane naw ni bout a pahnim awh han.
021	ECC	001	012	Kai, phungdeikung, Jerusalem khopui dawk Isarel siangpahrang lah ka o nah,
021	ECC	001	013	Kanî rahim vah sakyoe e pueng thoumthainae lahoi pakhingpalang lungthin ka tawng. Cathut ni taminaw koe khoram sak nahanelah a patangpalai sak.
021	ECC	001	014	Kanî rahim e hnosak e pueng ka hmu toe. Bangpueng ahrawnghrang doeh. Kahlî ka man e hoi doeh a kâvan.
