044	ACT	002	023	Cathut ni Jisuh teh nangmouh hanlah a hmoun tangcoung e hoi a panue tangcoung e patetlah, kâlawklaipa taminaw kut dawk hoi thingpalam dawk a pathout awh teh a thei awh.
044	ACT	002	024	Hat nakunghai Cathut ni ahni teh due reithainae thung hoi a thaw sak teh a hlout sak.
