044	ACT	002	031	Devit ni kamceng lah a panue dawkvah Khrih e boutthawnae kong hah hettelah a dei. Bawipa teh phuen dawk cettakhai mahoeh. A tak hai pawknae hoi kâhmo sak mahoeh a ti.
044	ACT	002	032	Cathut ni hote Jisuh hah a thaw sak toe. Maimanaw hai kapanuekkung lah o awh.
