044	ACT	021	020	Ahnimouh ni a thai awh navah Cathut a pholen awh. Hahoi ahnimouh ni Pawl koe, ka nawngha, na panue e patetlah Judahnaw touklek thai hoe e, kâlawk dawk a lungkatangnaw ni a yuem awh.
