# BOOK	058	HEB	Hebrews	Hebru
058	HEB	001	001	Yampa teh Cathut ni profetnaw hno laihoi mintoenaw koe aphunphun lahoi lawk a dei.
058	HEB	001	002	Hatei, atu hnukteng e atueng nah, a Capa hno laihoi maimouh koe lawk a dei. Cathut ni Capa teh hnocawngca e râw kacoekung lah a rawi. Hote a Capa lahoi talaivan hai a sak.
058	HEB	001	003	Capa teh, Cathut e bawilennae raeng hoi a coungnae kamnuek sak e lah ao. Ama e bahu hoi kakawi e a lawk hnosakthainae lahoi a cawngca pueng hah acak sak teh, maimae yonnae pueng hai ama roeroe ni a thoungsak hnukkhu, kalvan vah Bawilennae aranglah a tahung.
058	HEB	001	004	Kalvannaw e min hlakvah min a lentoe dawkvah kalvantaminaw hlak hai ka lentoe e lah ao.
058	HEB	001	005	Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh ka Capa lah na o, sahnin vah nang teh na khe tie thoseh, kai teh ahnie na pa lah ka o han, ahni hai kaie Capa lah ao han tie thoseh, telah kalvantaminaw koe tet pouh boihoeh.
058	HEB	001	006	Hahoi, Cathut ni a camin hah talaivan a patoun navah Cathut e kalvantami pueng ni ahni teh bawk awh naseh telah a ti.
058	HEB	001	007	Hahoi, kalvantaminaw hoi kâkuen lah, Bawipa ni a kalvantaminaw teh kahlî patetlah thoseh, a thaw katawknaw teh hmaipalai patetlah thoseh a coung sak, telah a ti.
058	HEB	001	008	Hateiteh, a Capa hoi kâkuen lah a dei e teh, Oe Cathut, Na bawitungkhung teh a yungyoe a kangning. Na Uknaeram teh na lannae hoi lawkcengnae ram lah ao.
058	HEB	001	009	Nang teh lannae hah na lungpataw teh, kathounghoehe hnonaw hah na hmuhma. Hatdawkvah, Oe Cathut, na Cathut ni na huikonaw hlak nang teh lunghawinae satui na awi toe telah a ti.
058	HEB	001	010	Cakathoung dawkvah bout a dei e patetlah, Oe Bawipa, nang ni apuengcue vah talai hah na sak, hahoi kalvannaw teh na kutsaknaw doeh.
058	HEB	001	011	Hatei, na kut sak hnonaw pueng teh kamko nakunghai, nang teh ayungyoe na kangning. Hno cawngca pueng teh khohna patetlah koung a pawn awh.
058	HEB	001	012	Bawipa ni hote hnonaw teh kâkhu e hni patetlah a kalawng teh, hotnaw teh khohna patetlah a kâthung han. Bawipa teh kâthung mahoeh. A hringnae hai abaw tie awm hoeh telah a ti.
058	HEB	001	013	Hothloilah, Cathut ni bang patet e kalvantami koe maw na tarannaw hah na khok toungnae lah kata hoehroukrak kaie aranglah, tahung loe atipouh boi vaw.
058	HEB	001	014	Kalvantaminaw pueng teh rungngangnae râw ka coe hane naw khetyawt hanelah, patoun e thawtawkkung muithanaw nahoehmaw.
058	HEB	002	001	Hatdawkvah, maimanaw teh thai awh e kamthang lawk hah pahnim hoeh nahanlah lungthin dawk hoe panue han ngainae tawn awh sei.
058	HEB	002	002	Kalvantaminaw hno lahoi a dei e lawk teh acak teh, payon kâtapoenae hoi lawkngaihoehnae pueng dawkvah ka kamcu e rektapnae khang a boipawiteh,
058	HEB	002	003	Hettelah totouh, kalen e rungngangnae heh banglahai noutna awh hoeh pawiteh, bangtelamaw yon phu khangnae dawk hoi hlout thai awh han vaw. Hote lawk teh apuengcue vah Bawipa ni a pâpho teh, ka thai e naw ni a kamsoum ati awh teh maimouh koe patuen a dei awh.
058	HEB	002	004	Cathut niyah mitnoutnaw, kângairuhnonaw a cawngca a sak e lahoi thoseh, kângairu hnosakthainae hoi thoseh, ama ngainae patetlah Kathoung Muitha ni poehnonaw na poe e lahoi thoseh, ahnimouh hoi cungtalah a kampangkhai.
058	HEB	002	005	Maimouh ni dei awh e ka tho hane talaivan uknae kâ teh Cathut ni kalvantaminaw e kut rahim hrueng hoeh.
058	HEB	002	006	Cakathoung hmuen buet touh dawk, tami heh bangtelah ao dawk maw Bawipa nang ni khuet na pouk. Tami Capa heh bangtelah ao dawk maw khuet na khet.
058	HEB	002	007	Ahni teh kalvantaminaw hlakvah dawngdengca bet a rahnoum sak teh, bawilennae hoi barinae lahoi bawilukhung a kâmuk sak, na kutsaknaw hah na uk sak teh,
058	HEB	002	008	hno cawngca pueng hah ahnie khok rahim vah a ta toe ati. Hno cawngca pueng hah ahnie khok rahim vah koung a ta toe ti navah, a pek e buet touh hai awmhoeh. Atu hno cawngca pueng hah rahim vah koung a ta e hah maimouh ni hmawt awh hoeh rah.
058	HEB	002	009	Hatei, Cathut e lungmanae lahoi, Jisuh teh tami pueng hanlah duenae khang hanelah, kalvantaminaw hlak dawngdengca bet a rahnoum sak teh, a due dawkvah, a lû dawk bawilennae hoi barinae bawilukhung a kâmuk e hah maimouh ni hmu awh.
058	HEB	002	010	Bangkongtetpawiteh, hnocawngca pueng e akungtuen lah kaawm e Cathut ni, ca moikapap hah bawilennae thung a hrawi navah, ahnimae rungngangnae kasakkung Bawipa teh reithainae hoi akuep sak e hah a kamcu doeh.
058	HEB	002	011	Kathoungsakkung hoi a thoungsak e taminaw pueng teh buet touh koehoi doeh a coung. Hatdawkvah, kathoungsakkung ni a thoungsak e naw hah hmaunawngha telah kaw hane kayakkhai hoeh.
058	HEB	002	012	Hottelah a kaw ngainae teh, ka hmaunawnghanaw koevah kamthang kahawi teh ka pâpho vaiteh, kakamkhuengnaw rahak vah nang pholennae la ka sak han, telah a ti.
058	HEB	002	013	Hahoi, Bawipa nang teh na yuem han. Hahoi, thai awh haw, kai hoi kai koe Cathut ni na poe e camonaw doeh, telah bout a ti.
058	HEB	002	014	Hote camonaw teh takthai hoi thi ka tawn e lah ao dawkvah, Khrih ni a duenae pawlawk dawk hoi, duenae ka uk e kahraimathout e bahu hah a raphoe thai nahanlah thoseh,
058	HEB	002	015	duenae ka taket niteh, a hring nathung sankatoungnaw hah hloutsak hanelah thoseh, hote camonaw patetvanlah takthai hoi thi a sin van.
058	HEB	002	016	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Khrih ni kalvantaminaw hah kabawm hoeh, Abraham e catounnaw hah a kabawp.
058	HEB	002	017	Hatdawkvah Khrih ni taminaw e yonthanae hah a sak teh, Cathut hoi kâkuen e dawkvah, lungmanae hoi thoseh, lawkkamcaknae hoi thoseh, yuemkamcu e Vaihma Kacue lah ao nahan, amae hmaunawnghanaw hoi khoeroe kâvan e lah ao.
058	HEB	002	018	Hottelah, ama roeroe tacueknae a khang dawkvah, yon tacueknae kakâhmonaw hah a kabawp thai.
058	HEB	003	001	Hatdawkvah kalvanlae kawnae na ka coe e hmaunawnghanaw, maimouh ni yuem awh e guncei hoi Vaihma Kacue lah kaawm e Khrih Jisuh e kong hah kahawicalah pouk awh.
058	HEB	003	002	Mosi teh Cathut e imthungkhu dawk yuemkamcu patetlah ahni haiyah ama kapatounkung koe yuemkamcu.
058	HEB	003	003	Im kasakkung teh im hlak bari hoe ao e patetlah, Jisuh teh Mosi hlak hai hoe ka talue e bawilennae coe hanlah a kamcu telah pouk e lah ao.
058	HEB	003	004	Im teh tami buet buet touh ni a sak dawk kaawm e doeh. Bangpuengpa kasakkung teh Cathut lah ao.
058	HEB	003	005	Mosi teh hmalah pâpho lah kaawm hane hnonaw lawkpanuesaknae lah ao nahan, Cathut e imthungkhu koe yuemkamcu lah ao.
058	HEB	003	006	Khrih teh capa patetlah Cathut e im thung yuemkamcu lah ao. Maimanaw teh yuemnae hoi ngaihawinae dawkvah kâoupnae hah apout totouh kuen awh pawiteh, Cathut e imthungkhu lah o awh.
058	HEB	003	007	Hatdawkvah, Kathoung Muitha ni a dei e teh, sahnin vah nangmanaw ni pâpho e lawk hah na thai awh dawkvah,
058	HEB	003	008	Na lung patak awh hanh.
058	HEB	003	009	Na mintoenaw ni a kum 40 touh thung kai hah aphunphun lahoi na tanouk awh teh, kaie thaw ka tawknae hah a hmunae kahrawngum vah kai na tarannae tueng patetlah awm awh hanh.
058	HEB	003	010	Hote miphunnaw teh ka panuet dawkvah, a lungthin thung hoi pou a payon awh. Kaie lamthung hai panuek awh hoeh.
058	HEB	003	011	Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh teh kaie kâhatnae dawk na kâen awh mahoeh telah lungkhuek laihoi thoe ka bo e patetlah,
058	HEB	003	012	hmaunawnghanaw, nangmouh teh kahring Cathut ceitakhai e lahoi yuemhoehnae hoi kahawihoehe lung na tawn awh hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet awh.
058	HEB	003	013	Nangmouh thung dawk yon phung ni dumnae lahoi na lungthin a pata hoeh nahanlah, sahnin telah kaw e atueng ao nathung, hnintangkuem buet touh hoi buet touh kâhroecoe awh.
058	HEB	003	014	Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimouh teh apuengcue hoi kaawm e lungtangnae hah, apout ditouh kacaklah na kuen pawiteh, Khrih hoi kâkuen e lah na o awh.
058	HEB	003	015	Cakathoung dawk sahnin vah nangmouh ni lawk hah na thai awh pawiteh, lawk tarannae tueng patetlah na lungthin patak sak awh hanh leih a ti.
058	HEB	003	016	Hottelah a thai awh nahlangva ka tarannaw teh, apinaw namaw. Mosi e hrawinae lahoi, Izip ram hoi ka tâcawt e taminaw nahoehmaw.
058	HEB	003	017	Hahoi, a kum 40 touh thung, Cathut teh apinaw e lathueng maw a lungkhuek. Yonnae ka sak awh ni teh kahrawngum vah kadoutnaw koe nahoehmaw.
058	HEB	003	018	Hothloilah, nangmouh teh Bawipa e kâhatnae dawk na kâen awh mahoeh telah apinaw maw thoe a bo vaw. Lawk ka ngai hoeh e taminaw koe nahoehmaw.
058	HEB	003	019	Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh teh a yuem awh hoeh dawkvah kâen thai awh hoeh tie teh maimouh ni panue awh.
058	HEB	004	001	Hatdawkvah, Cathut e kâhatnae dawk kâen thainae a lawkkam ao nahlangva, nangmouh thung dawk hoi kâen laipalah tami buet touh hai ao hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet awh sei.
058	HEB	004	002	Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimouh haiyah ahnimanaw patetvanlah kamthang kahawi hah thai awh toe. Hatei, ahnimouh ni a thai awh e kamthang lawk teh ahnimae thungvah, yuemnae hoi a kâkalawt hoeh dawkvah aphu awmhoeh.
058	HEB	004	003	Ka yuem e maimanaw teh Cathut e kâhatnae dawk kâen awh. Cakathoung dawk, Ahnimouh teh kaie kâhatnae dawk kâen mahoeh telah ka lungkhuek teh thoe ka bo e patetlah ao. Hatei, athawnaw teh talaivan kamtawng nah a cum e lah ao toe.
058	HEB	004	004	Asari hnin hoi kâkuen lah, Cathut ni hno pueng koung a cum hnukkhu, asari hnin vah duem a kâhat telah Cakathoung ni hmuen buet touh koe a dei.
058	HEB	004	005	Hahoi, ahnimouh teh kaie kâhatnae dawk kâen awh mahoeh, telah bout a ti.
058	HEB	004	006	Hatdawkvah, hote kâhatnae thungvah kâen thainae teh, atangawnnaw hanelah ao rah. Lunghawinae kamthang kahawi teh hmaloe ka thai e naw ni a yuem awh hoeh dawkvah kâen awh hoeh toe.
058	HEB	004	007	Hatdawkvah, Cathut ni hnin hnin touh hah sahnin telah a dei teh a kum moi asaw hnukkhu, ahmaloe a dei e patetlah sahnin a lawk na thai awh pawiteh, na lungpata sak awh hanh telah Devit hno lahoi a dei.
058	HEB	004	008	Joshua ni ahnimouh kâhatnae poe katang pawiteh, hat hnukkhu, alouke hnin hah Cathut ni a dei han namaw.
058	HEB	004	009	Hatdawkvah, Cathut e miphunnaw hanlah kâhatnae phun touh ao rah.
058	HEB	004	010	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni athawnaw hah a cum teh duem a kâhat e patetlah Bawipa e kâhatnae dawkvah ka kâen e tami hai thawnaw a cum vaiteh duem a kâhat van han.
058	HEB	004	011	Isarel taminaw ni yuemnae lungthin tawn laipalah a tâlaw awh e patetlah maimouh ni tâlaw laipalah hote kâhatnae dawk kâen hanlah kâpanki awh sei.
058	HEB	004	012	Cathut e lawk teh a hring, tahloi avoivang kahran e hlak a hran. Hringnae hoi muitha, hru kâletlout hoi rakhing totouh a thut teh a racei thai. Lungthin pouknae pueng hai a panue thai.
058	HEB	004	013	Sak e hnonaw pueng dawkvah Cathut hmalah ka kamnuek hoeh e buet touh boehai awm hoeh. Bangpuengpa teh, Bawipa e hmalah ka ngue e awm laipalah pheng a kamnue. Maimouh pueng teh hote Bawipa ni akung na khei awh han.
058	HEB	004	014	Atu kalvan kho ka kâen e Vaihma Kacue, Cathut Capa Jisuh teh maimouh koe kalenpounge Vaihma Kacue lah ao dawkvah, maimouh ni yuemnae lawk dawk kacaklah awm awh sei.
058	HEB	004	015	Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimouh thayounnae kapanuekkhaikung Vaihma Kacue tawn awh. Ahni teh maimouh patetlah tacueknae aphunphun a kâhmo. Hatei, yonnae tawn hoeh.
058	HEB	004	016	Hatdawkvah, maimouh teh a pahrennae hoi a lungmanae naw hah coe awh teh panki nah tueng nah kabawpnae hmu nahanlah lungtang nalaihoi lungmanae bawitungkhung koe rek hnai awh haw sei.
058	HEB	005	001	Taminaw thung dawk hoi rawi lah kaawm e vaihma kacuenaw pueng teh poehno poe hane hoi yon thuengnae hah taminaw han Cathut koe ka thueng hanelah rawi e lah ao.
058	HEB	005	002	Ama roeroe hai thayounnae a tawn dawkvah, panuenae ka tawn hoeh e naw hoi lam kapayonnaw koe pahrennae a tawn thai.
058	HEB	005	003	Hatdawkvah, taminaw e yon hoi amae yon hanlah thuengnae sak hanelah a panki.
058	HEB	005	004	Cathut ni Aron a kaw e patetlah kaw e tami laipalah, apinihai hote thaw bari kaawm e teh tawk thai awh hoeh.
058	HEB	005	005	Hot patetvanlah, Khrih haiyah, Vaihma Kacue lah amahmawk ka kâtawm e nahoeh. Nang teh ka Ca lah na o. Sahnin vah nang teh na khe toe, telah ka tet e ni a tawm toe.
058	HEB	005	006	Cakathoung ni a dei e, nang teh Melkhizedek patetlah yungyoe e vaihma lah na o, tie patetlah ao.
058	HEB	005	007	Khrih teh talai van ao navah, duenae koehoi rungngang thai kung koevah mitphi hoi puenghoi a hram laihoi ratoumnae a sak teh, takinae koehoi kâhatnae a hmu dawkvah,
058	HEB	005	008	ahni teh Cathut Capa lah kaawm ei nakunghai patang khangnae lahoi lawkngainae a kamtu.
058	HEB	005	009	Hottelah kuepnae koe a pha hnukkhu, lawk ka thai niteh ka yuem e naw pueng yungyoe rungngangnae kapoekung lah ao.
058	HEB	005	010	Melkhizedek patetlah Cathut ni Vaihma Kacue telah a kaw e lah ao.
058	HEB	005	011	Hotteh, Melkhizedek e kong dawk kaimouh ni dei hane moi ao, hatei, nangmouh teh hnâ na thai panuek awh hoeh dawkvah dei hane hroung a ru.
058	HEB	005	012	Bangkongtetpawiteh nangmouh teh a kumtha lahoi teh kacangkhaikung lah na o awh hanelah na o awh toe. Hatei, akungtuen e Cathut lawk hah ayâ koehoi bout kamtu hanlah ao dawkvah, bu kate na cat laipalah sanutui na ka net e lah doeh na o awh rah.
058	HEB	005	013	Sanu tui dueng ka net e tami teh camo lah ao rah dawkvah, lannae hoi ka kâkuen e lawk panuethainae tawn hoeh.
058	HEB	005	014	Bu kate tie teh, thoehawi kapek thainae a tawn teh, poukthainae, panuethainae lahoi cuenae koe lah kaawmnaw hane doeh.
058	HEB	006	001	Hatdawkvah, maimouh teh Khrih hoi kâkuen e akungtuen hoi kâcangkhainae hah ta awh vaiteh, kuepcingnae koe lah khok takan awh sei. Duenae hoi kâkuen e tawksaknae dawk hoi pan ka ngainae, Cathut yuemnae,
058	HEB	006	002	baptisma hoi kâkuen e cangkhainae, kut toungnae, duenae koehoi boutthawnae, yungyoe lawkcengnae hah a kung koehoi bout kamtu toung laipalah awm awh sei.
058	HEB	006	003	Cathut ni atueng na poe pawiteh hot teh sak awh han.
058	HEB	006	004	Angnae dawk vai touh pha awh teh, kalvanlae poehno pateknae, Kathoung Muitha coenae,
058	HEB	006	005	Cathut e kamthang kahawi hoi due hnukkhu hnosakthainae hah patek awh hnukkhu hoi,
058	HEB	006	006	tâlaw pawiteh, Cathut Capa thingpalam dawk apâhni lah bout a pathout awh teh yeirai a po sak awh dawkvah, pankângainae koe bout phat thai awh hoeh toe.
058	HEB	006	007	Bangkongtetpawiteh, talai ni ama dawk boutbout kabawt e kho ratui a dawp teh, thaw katawknaw hanlah anhnatuisue ouk tâcawtkhai pawiteh, Cathut koehoi e yawhawi a hmu e lah ao.
058	HEB	006	008	Hatei, pâkhing pâyam aphunphun kapâw sak e talai lah awm pawiteh, hno han a kamcu hoeh dawkvah, thoebonae a khang vaiteh, hnukteng vah hmai hoi sawi lah ao han.
058	HEB	006	009	Ka lungpataw e naw, kaimouh ni hettelah ka dei awh ei nakunghai, nangmouh hanelah teh hoe kahawi e rungngangnae hoi kâkuen lah ao tie ngaihawi awh.
058	HEB	006	010	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut teh nangmae thaw na tawk awh e hai thoseh, tami kathoungnaw yampa vah na khetyawt awh e patetlah atu hai Bawipa min lahoi na kamnue sak awh e lungpatawnae hai thoseh, pahnim totouh hno kahawihoeh ka sak e lah awmhoeh.
058	HEB	006	011	Nangmouh pueng teh, pangaknae tawn laipalah, yuemnae hoi panguepnae lahoi lawkkamnae râw lah kacoenaw patetvanlah na tarawi thai awh nahan,
058	HEB	006	012	hottelah apout totouh lunghringnae awm laipalah na ngaihawi awh nahan kaimouh ni na ngai khai awh.
058	HEB	006	013	Cathut ni Abraham koevah lawkkamnae a sak navah, ama hlak kalenhnawn e min ao hoeh dawkvah, amahoima noe lahoi,
