059	JAM	002	024	Hatdawkvah tami teh yuemnae lahoi dueng lannae dawk pha e nahoeh, tawknae lahoi pha e hah nangmouh ni na panue awh.
059	JAM	002	025	Hot patetvanlah, kâyawt e Rahab hai patounenaw a im a luen sak teh, alouke lam lahoi a ban sak toteh, hote tawknae lahoi lan toe telah khoe lah ao nahoehmaw.
059	JAM	002	026	Bangkongtetpawiteh, Muitha laipalah tak teh kadout e lah ao patetlah tawknae laipalah yuemnae hai kadout e lah ao.
