059	JAM	005	004	Thai awh haw, na law dawk thaw katawknaw hah kutphu poe laipalah, na dum awh teh hote aphu ni a hram toe. Cang ka a naw e hram lawk haiyah kalvan Cathut e a hnâ dawk a kâen toe.
059	JAM	005	005	Nangmouh teh het talai nawmnae dawk phunep awh toe.
